                        . "| 1 | Sub-CPMK 1.1: [Rumusan kalimat capaian lengkap] | [Topik materi minggu 1] | Kuliah (Visual/Auditori) | Ceramah interaktif, Diskusi | Menganalisis materi dan berdiskusi kelompok | {$menit_t}/{$menit_p} | Rubrik Partisipasi | Ketepatan analisis konsep dasar | 3% | [Sumber Belajar / Modul Pertemuan 1] |\n"
                        . "... (Minggu 2 s.d. 7)\n"
                        . "| 8 | Evaluasi Tengah Semester (UTS): Mengukur ketercapaian Sub-CPMK Minggu 1 s.d. 7 | Materi Perkuliahan Minggu 1 - 7 | Evaluasi Terstruktur | Ujian Tertulis / Evaluasi Proyek | Mengerjakan evaluasi tengah semester | {$menit_t}/{$menit_p} | Rubrik Penilaian UTS | Ketepatan dan kelengkapan jawaban ujian | 20% | [Evaluasi UTS] |\n"
                        . "... (Minggu 9 s.d. 15)\n"
                        . "| 16 | Evaluasi Akhir Semester (UAS): Mengukur ketercapaian seluruh CPMK (Komprehensif) | Materi Perkuliahan Minggu 9 - 15 (Komprehensif) | Evaluasi Terstruktur | Ujian Akhir / Presentasi Proyek Akhir | Melaksanakan ujian akhir semester / presentasi | {$menit_t}/{$menit_p} | Rubrik Penilaian UAS | Penguasaan komprehensif seluruh capaian | 25% | [Evaluasi UAS] |\n"
                        . "```\n\n"
                        . "* ATURAN KUNCI PENTING:\n"
                        . "  1. Kolom (2) Kemampuan Akhir: Wajib sertakan kode dan kalimat rumusan capaian lengkap (Contoh: 'Sub-CPMK 1.1: Mahasiswa mampu menganalisis...'). DILARANG hanya menulis 'Sub-CPMK 1.1' saja!\n"
                        . "  2. Kolom Waktu (T/P): Wajib persis '{$menit_t}/{$menit_p}' di setiap baris.\n"
                        . "  3. Bobot Asesmen: Total kolom Bobot thd MK wajib 100%, total Bobot thd CPMK per kelompok wajib 100%, dan total bobot pertemuan 1-16 wajib 100%.\n"
                        . "  4. Kolom Sumber Belajar: Rujuk nomor referensi yang sesuai atau cantumkan modul/materi pertemuan.\n"
                        . "  5. DILARANG KERAS MEMBUAT BAB PENUTUP, KESIMPULAN, ATAU TANDA TANGAN DI BAGIAN AKHIR.\n"
                        . "  6. DILARANG KERAS MEMBUAT / MENAMBAHKAN BAGIAN RANCANGAN TUGAS MAHASISWA. Dokumen RPS murni Rencana Pembelajaran Semester 16 Pertemuan dan terhubung langsung ke Kontrak Kuliah. Dokumen RPS wajib tuntas tepat pada Bagian 6 (Tabel 16 Pertemuan).\n";
                }
                break;
        }

        // =========================================================================
        // SUSUN USER CONTEXT DOCUMENT
        // =========================================================================
        $user_document = "## DATA INPUT MATA KULIAH:\n";
        $user_document .= "- Program Studi: " . ($prodi ?: '[Perlu Konfirmasi]') . "\n";
        $user_document .= "- Mata Kuliah: " . $mata_kuliah . "\n";
        $user_document .= "- Kode MK: " . ($kode_mk ?: '[Diisi Program Studi]') . "\n";
        $user_document .= "- Bobot SKS: " . $sks . " SKS (" . ($sks * 45) . " jam / semester)\n";
        $user_document .= "- Semester: " . ($semester ?: '[Diisi Program Studi]') . "\n";
        $user_document .= "- Dosen Pengampu: " . ($dosen ?: '[Diisi Dosen]') . "\n\n";

        if ($is_continuation && !empty($naskah_sebelumnya)) {
            // Bersihkan naskah dari markdown warning sebelumnya
            $cleaned_prev = preg_replace('/>\s*\[!WARNING\][\s\S]*$/i', '', $naskah_sebelumnya);
            $tail_length = 4000;
            $tail_context = (strlen($cleaned_prev) > $tail_length) ? substr($cleaned_prev, -$tail_length) : $cleaned_prev;

            $task_title = "LANJUTAN PENYUSUNAN DOKUMEN: {$task_title}";
            $task_instruction = "PERINTAH KELANJUTAN EKSKLUSIF (CONTINUATION):\n"
                . "Dokumen '{$task_title}' sebelumnya terputus karena batas maksimum token output AI.\n"
                . "Berikut adalah potongan teks bagian paling akhir yang SUDAH SELESAI disusun sebelumnya:\n"
                . "```markdown\n" . $tail_context . "\n```\n\n"
                . "INSTRUKSI KELANJUTAN KETAT & BATAS AKHIR MUTLAK:\n"
                . "1. TULISKAN LANGSUNG KELANJUTANNYA mulai dari baris/titik terputus di atas hingga seluruh pertemuan ke-16 (UAS) tuntas.\n"
                . "2. DILARANG KERAS mengulang judul dokumen, identitas, atau bab/tabel yang sudah selesai tertulis di atas.\n"
                . "3. Jika terputus di tengah tabel (misal Tabel 16 Pertemuan), lanjutkan baris pertemuan berikutnya dengan format tabel markdown yang valid (|...|...|). JANGAN mengulang baris header tabel jika tabel sebelumnya masih berlangsung.\n"
                . "4. ⛔ BATAS AKHIR DOKUMEN RPS ADALAH PERTEMUAN KE-16 (UAS): DILARANG KERAS menambahkan bagian baru setelah baris Pertemuan 16 (DILARANG menambahkan Rancangan Tugas, DILARANG membuat Lampiran, DILARANG membuat Lembar Pengesahan / Bab Penutup). Begitu baris Pertemuan Ke-16 selesai, AI WAJIB LANGSUNG BERHENTI!\n";
        } elseif (!empty($naskah_sebelumnya)) {
            $user_document .= "## NASKAH DRAF AKTIF SAAT INI (ACUAN REVISI):\n";
            $user_document .= "Berikut adalah naskah dokumen yang saat ini sudah terbentuk:\n```markdown\n" . substr($naskah_sebelumnya, 0, 30000) . "\n```\n";
            $user_document .= "Jika pengguna memberikan instruksi revisi/penyesuaian di atas, terapkan perubahan tersebut secara presisi pada naskah ini sambil mempertahankan kelengkapan struktur dan format secara utuh.\n\n";
        }

        if (!empty($catatan_khusus)) {
            $user_document .= "## INSTRUKSI / CATATAN KHUSUS PENGGUNA:\n" . $catatan_khusus . "\n\n";
        }

        if (!empty($teks_rps_induk) && $mode !== 'susun_rps') {
            $user_document .= "## DOKUMEN MASTER RPS RESMI (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH):\n";
            $user_document .= "Berikut adalah naskah Rencana Pembelajaran Semester (RPS) resmi yang telah disusun untuk mata kuliah ini:\n```markdown\n" . substr($teks_rps_induk, 0, 45000) . "\n```\n";
            $user_document .= "INSTRUKSI PENYELARASAN MUTLAK:\n";
            $user_document .= "1. CAPAIAN (CPMK & Sub-CPMK): Gunakan rumusan capaian yang persis sama dengan yang ada di naskah Master RPS di atas.\n";
            $user_document .= "2. ASESMEN & BOBOT PENILAIAN: Anda WAJIB MENGADOPSI PERSIS nama-nama komponen penilaian dan angka persentase bobot yang ada pada tabel Matriks Korelasi CPMK vs Bentuk Penilaian (Blueprint Asesmen OBE) di naskah Master RPS di atas! DILARANG KERAS mengubah persentase, mengarang bobot baru, atau memecah komponen penilaian yang berbeda dari Matriks RPS tersebut. Total bobot wajib persis 100%.\n";
            $user_document .= "3. JADWAL MATERI 16 PERTEMUAN & REFERENSI: Wajib 100% selaras dengan tabel rencana mingguan dan daftar referensi di naskah Master RPS di atas.\n\n";
        }

        if (!empty($teks_excel_pertemuan)) {
            $user_document .= "## DOKUMEN RINCIAN 16 PERTEMUAN (DARI EXCEL DOSEN - 13 KOLOM):\n";
            $user_document .= "Berikut adalah rincian 16 pertemuan yang telah disusun dosen dan WAJIB diselaraskan pada rumusan CPMK & Blueprint Asesmen Bagian 3:\n";
            $user_document .= substr($teks_excel_pertemuan, 0, 30000) . "\n\n";
        }

        $user_document .= "## DOKUMEN ACUAN 1: KURIKULUM & CPL PRODI\n";
        if (!empty($teks_kurikulum)) {
            $user_document .= substr($teks_kurikulum, 0, 40000) . "\n\n";
        } else {
            $user_document .= "[Dokumen kurikulum tidak dilampirkan. Gunakan data standar CPL dan Bahan Kajian resmi prodi terkait tanpa mengarang data fiktif].\n\n";
        }

        $user_document .= "## DOKUMEN ACUAN 2: DATA PENELITIAN & PUBLIKASI DOSEN (OPSIONAL)\n";
        if (!empty($teks_penelitian)) {
            $user_document .= substr($teks_penelitian, 0, 25000) . "\n\n";
        } else {
            $user_document .= "[Data penelitian dosen tidak dilampirkan. DILARANG KERAS MENGARANG/MEMBUAT PENELITIAN PALSU. Hanya gunakan referensi buku/standar resmi yang nyata dan valid dari kurikulum].\n\n";
        }

        if (!empty($teks_rps_lama)) {
            $user_document .= "## DOKUMEN ACUAN 3: DRAFT RPS SEBELUMNYA / BAHAN KAJIAN\n";
            $user_document .= substr($teks_rps_lama, 0, 25000) . "\n\n";
        }

        $user_document .= "## PERINTAH EKSEKUSI UTAMA:\n"
            . "Berdasarkan seluruh Dokumen Acuan Kurikulum & CPL di atas, susunlah sekarang dokumen '{$task_title}' secara lengkap, spesifik, kontekstual, dan aplikatif sesuai mata kuliah {$mata_kuliah} (Prodi {$prodi}).\n"
            . "WAJIB ikuti seluruh struktur bab dan pedoman penilaian tanpa melewatkan satu pertemuan pun (Pertemuan 1 s.d. 16).\n\n";

        $full_prompt = "=== PERINTAH TUGAS: {$task_title} ===\n\n" . $task_instruction;

        // Call Ai_reviewer
        $require_json = ($mode === 'export_siakad_json' || $mode === 'susun_cpmk' || $mode === 'revisi_cpmk_item');
        $ai_result = $this->ai_reviewer->generate_review(
            $provider,
            $api_key,
            $system_prompt . "\n\n" . $full_prompt,
            $user_document,
            false,
            $require_json,
            $model
        );

        if (!$ai_result['status']) {
            echo json_encode(['status' => false, 'msg' => $ai_result['msg']]);
            return;
        }

        $result_text   = $ai_result['review'];
        $finish_reason = $ai_result['finish_reason'] ?? null;
        $is_truncated  = $ai_result['is_truncated'] ?? (!empty($finish_reason) && in_array(strtoupper($finish_reason), ['MAX_TOKENS', 'LENGTH']));

        // Khusus Mode revisi_cpmk_item: validasi dan kembalikan SATU butir CPMK
        if ($mode === 'revisi_cpmk_item') {
            $single_item = $this->_parse_single_cpmk_json($result_text, $target_item ?? [], $allowed_cpl_codes);
            if (!$single_item || empty($single_item['teks'])) {
                echo json_encode([
                    'status' => false,
                    'msg'    => 'Format JSON perbaikan CPMK dari AI tidak valid atau kosong. Silakan coba lagi.'
                ]);
                return;
            }
            echo json_encode([
                'status' => true,
                'mode'   => 'revisi_cpmk_item',
                'cpmk'   => $single_item
            ]);
            return;
        }

        // Khusus Mode susun_cpmk: validasi dan kembalikan JSON terstruktur
        if ($mode === 'susun_cpmk') {
            $cpmk_items = $this->_parse_and_validate_cpmk_json($result_text, $allowed_cpl_codes);
            if (empty($cpmk_items)) {
                echo json_encode([
                    'status' => false,
                    'msg'    => 'Format JSON CPMK dari AI tidak valid atau kosong. Silakan coba lagi atau berikan instruksi tambahan.'
                ]);
                return;
            }

            // Simpan draf CPMK AI langsung ke database siakad_rps_obe agar persistent & tidak hilang saat reload
            $user = (!empty($this->ion_auth) && method_exists($this->ion_auth, 'user')) ? $this->ion_auth->user()->row() : null;
            $user_email = ($user && !empty($user->email)) ? $user->email : ($this->session->userdata('email') ?: ($id_ptk ?: 'dosen'));
            
            $cpmk_json_str = json_encode($cpmk_items, JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE | JSON_PRETTY_PRINT);
            $tujuan_belajar_lines = [];
            foreach ($cpmk_items as $idx => $item) {
                $cpl_str = !empty($item['primary_cpl']) ? (' (CPL: ' . implode(', ', $item['primary_cpl']) . ')') : '';
                $tujuan_belajar_lines[] = ($idx + 1) . ". **" . $item['code'] . ":** " . $item['rumusan'] . $cpl_str;
            }
            $tujuan_belajar_text = implode("\n", $tujuan_belajar_lines);

            $update_cpmk = [
                'cpmk_json'      => $cpmk_json_str,
                'cpmk_status'    => 'AI_PROPOSAL',
                'tujuan_belajar' => $tujuan_belajar_text,
                'change_by'      => $user_email,
                'change_date'    => date('Y-m-d H:i:s')
            ];

            if (!empty($kode_mk)) {
                $this->db->where('kode_mk', $kode_mk)->where('id_ptk', $id_ptk)->order_by('id_rps', 'DESC')->limit(1)->update('siakad_rps_obe', $update_cpmk);
            } elseif (!empty($mata_kuliah)) {
                $this->db->where('nm_mk', $mata_kuliah)->where('id_ptk', $id_ptk)->order_by('id_rps', 'DESC')->limit(1)->update('siakad_rps_obe', $update_cpmk);
            }

            echo json_encode([
                'status'        => true,
                'mode'          => 'susun_cpmk',
                'title'         => $task_title,
                'cpmk_data'     => $cpmk_items,
                'cpmk_status'   => 'AI_PROPOSAL',
                'output'        => $result_text,
                'finish_reason' => $finish_reason
            ]);
            return;
        }

        // Auto-sanitize jika AI masih menghasilkan '50/0' atau tidak mencantumkan jam praktek
        if ($mode === 'susun_rps' && $sks_prak > 0) {
            $target_ratio = "{$menit_t}/{$menit_p}";
            $result_text = preg_replace('/\|\s*(?:50|100|150)\s*\/\s*0\s*\|/i', "| {$target_ratio} |", $result_text);
        }

        // Auto-sanitize jika ada format numbered list pada item tunggal (Prasyarat / Deskripsi)
        $result_text = preg_replace('/^\s*1\.\s*[\*\-]?\s*Tidak ada\s*$/mi', 'Tidak ada', $result_text);
        $result_text = preg_replace('/\|\s*1\.\s*[\*\-]?\s*Tidak ada\s*\|/mi', '| Tidak ada |', $result_text);
        $result_text = preg_replace('/^\s*1\.\s+Deskripsi Singkat:\s*/mi', '', $result_text);
        $result_text = preg_replace('/\|\s*1\.\s+Deskripsi Singkat:\s*/mi', '| ', $result_text);

        // Auto-sanitize format tabel Markdown agar selalu valid GFM & tidak terputus
        $result_text = $this->sanitize_markdown_tables($result_text);

        // Auto-sanitize jika AI menghasilkan bagian halusinasi setelah Pertemuan 16 (Rancangan Tugas / Lampiran / Penutup) pada mode susun_rps
        if ($mode === 'susun_rps') {
            $result_text = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:(?:BAGIAN|BAB|SEKSI|POIN|BAG)\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]+\s*)?(?:RANCANGAN\s*TUGAS|TUGAS\s*MAHASISWA|LEMBAR\s*PENGESAHAN|PENGESAHAN|LAMPIRAN|PENUTUP)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $result_text);
            $result_text = trim($result_text);
        }

        // Jika mode susun_rps dan ada file Excel 16 pertemuan, sambungkan tabel Bagian 6 dari Excel
        $parsed_excel_matrix = null;
        if ($mode === 'susun_rps' && !empty($teks_excel_pertemuan)) {
            // Bersihkan jika AI tidak sengaja memproduksi sisa Bagian 6
            $result_text = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:(?:BAGIAN|BAB|SEKSI|POIN|BAG)\s*)?(?:6[\.\)]\s*)?DETAIL RENCANA PEMBELAJARAN[\s\S]*$/i', '', $result_text);
            $result_text = trim($result_text) . "\n\n" . trim($teks_excel_pertemuan);

            if (!empty($excel_matrix_json)) {
                $parsed_excel_matrix = json_decode($excel_matrix_json, true);
            }
        }

        echo json_encode([
            'status'          => true,
            'mode'            => $mode,
            'title'           => $task_title,
            'output'          => $result_text,
            'matrix_data'     => $parsed_excel_matrix,
            'is_continuation' => $is_continuation,
            'is_truncated'    => $is_truncated,
            'finish_reason'   => $finish_reason
        ]);
    }

    /**
     * Helper: Parse dan Validasi JSON Output CPMK dari AI (Strict Domain Policy & Zero Pseudo-Labels)
     */
    private function _parse_and_validate_cpmk_json($raw_text, $allowed_cpls = [])
    {
        $clean = trim((string)$raw_text);
        if (preg_match('/```(?:json)?\s*([\s\S]*?)\s*```/i', $clean, $m)) {
            $clean = trim($m[1]);
        }

        $decoded = json_decode($clean, true);

        // Fallback jika ada trailing commas atau noise di luar JSON
        if (!is_array($decoded)) {
            $first_brace = strpos($clean, '{');
            $last_brace  = strrpos($clean, '}');
            if ($first_brace !== false && $last_brace !== false && $last_brace > $first_brace) {
                $sub = substr($clean, $first_brace, $last_brace - $first_brace + 1);
                $sub = preg_replace('/,\s*([\}\]])/', '$1', $sub);
                $decoded = json_decode($sub, true);
            }
        }

        if (!is_array($decoded)) {
            return [];
        }

        $raw_list = $decoded['cpmk'] ?? (isset($decoded[0]) ? $decoded : []);
        if (!is_array($raw_list) || empty($raw_list)) {
            return [];
        }

        // Siapkan lookup allowed CPL jika disediakan
        $allowed_lookup = [];
        if (!empty($allowed_cpls) && is_array($allowed_cpls)) {
            foreach ($allowed_cpls as $ac) {
                $allowed_lookup[strtoupper(trim((string)$ac))] = true;
            }
        }

        $valid_bloom = ['C2' => true, 'C3' => true, 'C4' => true, 'C5' => true, 'C6' => true];
        $valid_prov  = ['AI_PROPOSAL' => true, 'MANUAL' => true, 'APPROVED' => true, 'FACTUAL' => true, 'MANUAL_DERIVED_FROM_OFFICIAL' => true];

        $items = [];
        $seen_texts = [];

        foreach ($raw_list as $row) {
            if (!is_array($row)) {
                continue;
            }

            $teks = '';
            if (!empty($row['rumusan'])) {
                $teks = trim((string)$row['rumusan']);
            } elseif (!empty($row['teks'])) {
                $teks = trim((string)$row['teks']);
            } elseif (!empty($row['deskripsi'])) {
                $teks = trim((string)$row['deskripsi']);
            } elseif (!empty($row['cpmk']) && is_string($row['cpmk'])) {
                $teks = trim((string)$row['cpmk']);
            }
            if (empty($teks)) {
                continue;
            }

            // Bersihkan label (C4) atau sejenisnya di dalam kalimat teks
            $teks = preg_replace('/\s*[\(\[]C[1-6][\)\]]\s*/i', ' ', $teks);
            $teks = trim(preg_replace('/\s+/', ' ', $teks));

            // Filter item duplikat berdasarkan kesamaan teks
            $text_hash = mb_strtolower($teks);
            if (isset($seen_texts[$text_hash])) {
                continue;
            }
            $seen_texts[$text_hash] = true;

            // Validasi & normalisasi primary_cpl / cpl_terkait
            $raw_p_cpls = $row['primary_cpl'] ?? ($row['cpl_terkait'] ?? []);
            if (is_string($raw_p_cpls)) {
                $raw_p_cpls = explode(',', $raw_p_cpls);
            }
            $primary_cpl = [];
            if (is_array($raw_p_cpls)) {
                foreach ($raw_p_cpls as $rc) {
                    $std_c = strtoupper(trim((string)$rc));
                    if (!empty($std_c)) {
                        if (!empty($allowed_lookup)) {
                            if (isset($allowed_lookup[$std_c])) {
                                $primary_cpl[] = $std_c;
                            }
                        } else {
                            if (preg_match('/^(?:S|P|KU|U|KK|KS|CPL)-\d{1,2}$/', $std_c)) {
                                $primary_cpl[] = $std_c;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
                $primary_cpl = array_values(array_unique($primary_cpl));
            }

            // Validasi & normalisasi supporting_cpl
            $raw_s_cpls = $row['supporting_cpl'] ?? [];
            if (is_string($raw_s_cpls)) {
                $raw_s_cpls = explode(',', $raw_s_cpls);
            }
            $supporting_cpl = [];
            if (is_array($raw_s_cpls)) {
                foreach ($raw_s_cpls as $rc) {
                    $std_c = strtoupper(trim((string)$rc));
                    if (!empty($std_c)) {
                        if (!empty($allowed_lookup)) {
                            if (isset($allowed_lookup[$std_c]) && !in_array($std_c, $primary_cpl)) {
                                $supporting_cpl[] = $std_c;
                            }
                        } else {
                            if (preg_match('/^(?:S|P|KU|U|KK|KS|CPL)-\d{1,2}$/', $std_c) && !in_array($std_c, $primary_cpl)) {
                                $supporting_cpl[] = $std_c;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
                $supporting_cpl = array_values(array_unique($supporting_cpl));
            }

            // Validasi Taksonomi Bloom C2-C6 (Strict: Tolak/Reject jika di luar C2-C6, jangan ubah diam-diam ke C4)
            $raw_bloom = !empty($row['level_bloom']) ? strtoupper(trim((string)$row['level_bloom'])) : (!empty($row['bloom']) ? strtoupper(trim((string)$row['bloom'])) : '');
            if (empty($raw_bloom) || !isset($valid_bloom[$raw_bloom])) {
                // Reject invalid bloom item
                continue;
            }
            $level_bloom = $raw_bloom;

            // Validasi Provenance
            $provenance = !empty($row['provenance']) ? strtoupper(trim((string)$row['provenance'])) : 'AI_PROPOSAL';
            if (!isset($valid_prov[$provenance])) {
                $provenance = 'AI_PROPOSAL';
            }

            $bahan_kajian = !empty($row['bahan_kajian']) ? (is_array($row['bahan_kajian']) ? $row['bahan_kajian'] : explode(',', $row['bahan_kajian'])) : [];

            // Normalisasi urutan kode CPMK-1, CPMK-2, ...
            $seq = count($items) + 1;
            $items[] = [
                'id'             => !empty($row['id']) ? trim((string)$row['id']) : ('cpmk_' . $seq),
                'code'           => 'CPMK-' . $seq,
                'kode'           => 'CPMK-' . $seq,
                'rumusan'        => $teks,
                'teks'           => $teks,
                'primary_cpl'    => $primary_cpl,
                'cpl_terkait'    => $primary_cpl,
                'supporting_cpl' => $supporting_cpl,
                'bahan_kajian'   => $bahan_kajian,
                'level_bloom'    => $level_bloom,
                'provenance'     => $provenance,
                'source_type'    => $row['source_type'] ?? ($provenance === 'FACTUAL' ? 'OFFICIAL_CURRICULUM' : 'AI_GENERATION')
            ];
        }

        // JAMINAN 100% PRIMARY CPL COVERAGE: Pastikan setiap Primary CPL dari allowed_cpls terpetakan
        if (!empty($allowed_lookup) && !empty($items)) {
            $covered_lookup = [];
            foreach ($items as $it) {
                foreach ($it['primary_cpl'] as $pc) {
                    $covered_lookup[$pc] = true;
                }
            }
            foreach ($allowed_lookup as $req_cpl => $val) {
                // Abaikan jika CPL sikap/supporting (misal S-11)
                if (stripos($req_cpl, 'S-') === 0) {
                    continue;
                }
                if (!isset($covered_lookup[$req_cpl])) {
                    // Temukan butir CPMK yang paling relevan secara semantik
                    $best_idx = 0;
                    $matched = false;
                    foreach ($items as $idx => $it) {
                        $txt = mb_strtolower($it['rumusan']);
                        if (stripos($req_cpl, 'P-') !== false && (stripos($txt, 'uji') !== false || stripos($txt, 'evaluasi') !== false || stripos($txt, 'test') !== false)) {
                            $best_idx = $idx; $matched = true; break;
                        } elseif (stripos($req_cpl, 'KS-3') !== false && (stripos($txt, 'metode') !== false || stripos($txt, 'model') !== false || stripos($txt, 'arsitektur') !== false)) {
                            $best_idx = $idx; $matched = true; break;
                        } elseif (stripos($req_cpl, 'KS-7') !== false && (stripos($txt, 'solusi') !== false || stripos($txt, 'rancang') !== false || stripos($txt, 'basis data') !== false || stripos($txt, 'skema') !== false)) {
                            $best_idx = $idx; $matched = true; break;
                        } elseif (stripos($req_cpl, 'KS-12') !== false && (stripos($txt, 'framework') !== false || stripos($txt, 'aplikasi') !== false)) {
                            $best_idx = $idx; $matched = true; break;
                        }
                    }
                    if (!$matched) {
                        $best_idx = count($items) - 1; // default ke item CPMK terakhir
                    }
                    if (!in_array($req_cpl, $items[$best_idx]['primary_cpl'])) {
                        $items[$best_idx]['primary_cpl'][] = $req_cpl;
                        $items[$best_idx]['cpl_terkait'][] = $req_cpl;
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        return $items;
    }

    /**
     * Helper: Parse output single CPMK item dari AI untuk mode revisi_cpmk_item
     */
    private function _parse_single_cpmk_json($raw_text, $fallback_item = [], $allowed_cpls = [])
    {
        $clean = trim((string)$raw_text);
        if (preg_match('/```(?:json)?\s*([\s\S]*?)\s*```/i', $clean, $m)) {
            $clean = trim($m[1]);
        }

        $decoded = json_decode($clean, true);
        if (!is_array($decoded)) {
            $first_brace = strpos($clean, '{');
            $last_brace  = strrpos($clean, '}');
            if ($first_brace !== false && $last_brace !== false && $last_brace > $first_brace) {
                $sub = substr($clean, $first_brace, $last_brace - $first_brace + 1);
                $sub = preg_replace('/,\s*([\}\]])/', '$1', $sub);
                $decoded = json_decode($sub, true);
            }
        }

        if (!is_array($decoded)) {
            return null;
        }

        $item_data = $decoded['cpmk'] ?? $decoded;
        if (isset($item_data[0]) && is_array($item_data[0])) {
            $item_data = $item_data[0];
        }

        if (!is_array($item_data)) {
            return null;
        }

        $teks = '';
        if (!empty($item_data['rumusan'])) {
            $teks = trim((string)$item_data['rumusan']);
        } elseif (!empty($item_data['teks'])) {
            $teks = trim((string)$item_data['teks']);
        } elseif (!empty($item_data['deskripsi'])) {
            $teks = trim((string)$item_data['deskripsi']);
        } elseif (!empty($item_data['cpmk']) && is_string($item_data['cpmk'])) {
            $teks = trim((string)$item_data['cpmk']);
        }
        if (empty($teks)) {
            return null;
        }

        $teks = preg_replace('/\s*[\(\[]C[1-6][\)\]]\s*/i', ' ', $teks);
        $teks = trim(preg_replace('/\s+/', ' ', $teks));

        $allowed_lookup = [];
        if (!empty($allowed_cpls) && is_array($allowed_cpls)) {
            foreach ($allowed_cpls as $ac) {
                $allowed_lookup[strtoupper(trim((string)$ac))] = true;
            }
        }

        $raw_p_cpls = $item_data['primary_cpl'] ?? ($item_data['cpl_terkait'] ?? ($fallback_item['primary_cpl'] ?? ($fallback_item['cpl_terkait'] ?? [])));
        if (is_string($raw_p_cpls)) {
            $raw_p_cpls = explode(',', $raw_p_cpls);
        }
        $primary_cpl = [];
        if (is_array($raw_p_cpls)) {
            foreach ($raw_p_cpls as $rc) {
                $std_c = strtoupper(trim((string)$rc));
                if (!empty($std_c)) {
                    if (!empty($allowed_lookup)) {
                        if (isset($allowed_lookup[$std_c])) {
                            $primary_cpl[] = $std_c;
                        }
                    } else {
                        if (preg_match('/^(?:S|P|KU|U|KK|KS|CPL)-\d{1,2}$/', $std_c)) {
                            $primary_cpl[] = $std_c;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            $primary_cpl = array_values(array_unique($primary_cpl));
        }

        $raw_s_cpls = $item_data['supporting_cpl'] ?? ($fallback_item['supporting_cpl'] ?? []);
        if (is_string($raw_s_cpls)) {
            $raw_s_cpls = explode(',', $raw_s_cpls);
        }
        $supporting_cpl = [];
        if (is_array($raw_s_cpls)) {
            foreach ($raw_s_cpls as $rc) {
                $std_c = strtoupper(trim((string)$rc));
                if (!empty($std_c)) {
                    if (!empty($allowed_lookup)) {
                        if (isset($allowed_lookup[$std_c]) && !in_array($std_c, $primary_cpl)) {
                            $supporting_cpl[] = $std_c;
                        }
                    } else {
                        if (preg_match('/^(?:S|P|KU|U|KK|KS|CPL)-\d{1,2}$/', $std_c) && !in_array($std_c, $primary_cpl)) {
                            $supporting_cpl[] = $std_c;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            $supporting_cpl = array_values(array_unique($supporting_cpl));
        }

        $valid_bloom = ['C2' => true, 'C3' => true, 'C4' => true, 'C5' => true, 'C6' => true];
        $raw_bloom   = !empty($item_data['level_bloom']) ? strtoupper(trim((string)$item_data['level_bloom'])) : (!empty($item_data['bloom']) ? strtoupper(trim((string)$item_data['bloom'])) : ($fallback_item['level_bloom'] ?? ''));
        if (empty($raw_bloom) || !isset($valid_bloom[$raw_bloom])) {
            return null; // Reject invalid bloom
        }
        $level_bloom = $raw_bloom;

        $bahan_kajian = !empty($item_data['bahan_kajian']) ? (is_array($item_data['bahan_kajian']) ? $item_data['bahan_kajian'] : explode(',', $item_data['bahan_kajian'])) : ($fallback_item['bahan_kajian'] ?? []);

        return [
            'id'             => !empty($item_data['id']) ? trim((string)$item_data['id']) : ($fallback_item['id'] ?? 'cpmk_1'),
            'code'           => !empty($item_data['code']) ? trim((string)$item_data['code']) : (!empty($item_data['kode']) ? trim((string)$item_data['kode']) : ($fallback_item['code'] ?? ($fallback_item['kode'] ?? 'CPMK-1'))),
            'kode'           => !empty($item_data['kode']) ? trim((string)$item_data['kode']) : (!empty($item_data['code']) ? trim((string)$item_data['code']) : ($fallback_item['kode'] ?? 'CPMK-1')),
            'rumusan'        => $teks,
            'teks'           => $teks,
            'primary_cpl'    => $primary_cpl,
            'cpl_terkait'    => $primary_cpl,
            'supporting_cpl' => $supporting_cpl,
            'bahan_kajian'   => $bahan_kajian,
            'level_bloom'    => $level_bloom,
            'provenance'     => 'AI_PROPOSAL',
            'source_type'    => 'AI_GENERATION'
        ];
    }

    /**
     * Export RPS Matrix into official WBI SIAKAD Excel template
     */
    public function export_excel_wbi()
    {
        $template_path = APPPATH . 'libraries/ai_skills/akademik-dosen-obe-fiq/templates/template_rps_wbi_rincian_pertemuan.xlsx';
        if (!file_exists($template_path)) {
            // Fallback path
            $template_path = APPPATH . 'third_party/rps_obe/template_rps_wbi_rincian_pertemuan.xlsx';
        }
        if (!file_exists($template_path)) {
            show_error('Template file tidak ditemukan di server: ' . $template_path);
            return;
        }

        $json_data = $this->input->post('matrix_json');
        $kode_mk   = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9_\-]/', '', $this->input->post('kode_mk') ?: 'MK');
        $nama_mk   = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9_\-]/', '_', $this->input->post('nama_mk') ?: 'RPS');
        $raw_ref   = $this->input->post('referensi') ?: '';

        $rows = json_decode($json_data, true);
        if (!is_array($rows) || empty($rows)) {
            show_error('Data matriks pertemuan tidak valid untuk diekspor ke Excel.');
            return;
        }

        // Ekstrak dan mapping referensi
        [$ref_map, $ref_short_map] = $this->parse_reference_map_for_excel($raw_ref);

        $clean_cell_text = function($val) {
            if ($val === null || $val === '') return '';
            $val = str_ireplace(['<br>', '<br/>', '<br />', '</p>', '</li>'], "\n", (string)$val);
            $val = strip_tags($val);
            $val = html_entity_decode($val, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8');
            $val = preg_replace('/\*\*(.*?)\*\*/s', '$1', $val);
            $val = preg_replace('/(?<!\w)__(.*?)__(?!\w)/s', '$1', $val);
            $val = preg_replace('/(?<!\*)\*(?!\s)([^\*\n]+?)(?<!\s)\*(?!\*)/s', '$1', $val);
            $val = preg_replace('/(?<![a-zA-Z0-9_])_(?!\s)([^_\n]+?)(?<!\s)_(?![a-zA-Z0-9_])/', '$1', $val);
            return trim($val);
        };

        try {
            $spreadsheet = IOFactory::load($template_path);
            $sheet = $spreadsheet->getActiveSheet();

            // Isi baris 6 s.d 21 (Minggu 1-16)
            // Baris 1: header teknis (KOLOM_1..KOLOM_13) — JANGAN DIUBAH
            // Baris 2-3: header manusia
            // Baris 4: nomor kolom (1)-(13)
            // Baris 5: tipe data
            // Baris 6-21: data minggu 1-16
            $start_row = 6;
            foreach ($rows as $index => $r) {
                $row_num = $start_row + $index;
                if ($row_num > 21) break; // Maks 16 pertemuan

                $raw_sumber = $r['sumber_belajar'] ?? '';
                $sumber_clean = $this->format_sumber_belajar_excel($raw_sumber, $ref_map, $ref_short_map);

                // Kolom A: Minggu-Ke
                $sheet->setCellValue('A' . $row_num, (int)($r['minggu'] ?? ($index + 1)));
                // Kolom B: Pertemuan
                $sheet->setCellValue('B' . $row_num, (int)($r['pertemuan'] ?? ($index + 1)));
                // Kolom C: Kemampuan Akhir Tiap Tahapan Belajar (Sub-CPMK)
                if (isset($r['sub_cpmk'])) $sheet->setCellValue('C' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['sub_cpmk']));
                // Kolom D: Bahan Kajian
                if (isset($r['bahan_kajian'])) $sheet->setCellValue('D' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['bahan_kajian']));
                // Kolom E: Bentuk & Modalitas
                if (isset($r['bentuk_pembelajaran'])) $sheet->setCellValue('E' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['bentuk_pembelajaran']));
                // Kolom F: Metode
                if (isset($r['metode'])) $sheet->setCellValue('F' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['metode']));
                // Kolom G: Pengalaman Belajar
                if (isset($r['pengalaman_belajar'])) $sheet->setCellValue('G' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['pengalaman_belajar']));
                // Kolom H: Waktu Teori (Integer menit)
                if (isset($r['waktu_teori'])) $sheet->setCellValue('H' . $row_num, (int)$r['waktu_teori']);
                // Kolom I: Waktu Praktek (Integer menit)
                if (isset($r['waktu_praktek'])) $sheet->setCellValue('I' . $row_num, (int)$r['waktu_praktek']);
                // Kolom J: Kriteria Evaluasi
                if (isset($r['kriteria_evaluasi'])) $sheet->setCellValue('J' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['kriteria_evaluasi']));
                // Kolom K: Indikator Evaluasi
                if (isset($r['indikator_evaluasi'])) $sheet->setCellValue('K' . $row_num, $clean_cell_text($r['indikator_evaluasi']));
                // Kolom L: Bobot (Integer %)
                if (isset($r['bobot'])) $sheet->setCellValue('L' . $row_num, (int)$r['bobot']);
                // Kolom M: Sumber Belajar
                $sheet->setCellValue('M' . $row_num, $sumber_clean);
            }

            // Rapikan alignment dan wrap text untuk cell data
            $sheet->getStyle('A6:M21')->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_TOP);
            $sheet->getStyle('C6:M21')->getAlignment()->setWrapText(true);
            $sheet->setCellValue('A23', 'Keterangan: M = Minggu, P = Pertemuan, T = Teori (dalam menit), Pr = Praktek (dalam menit)');
            $sheet->getStyle('A23')->getFont()->setItalic(true)->setSize(9);

            $filename = "RPS_{$kode_mk}_{$nama_mk}_RincianPertemuan_WBI.xlsx";

            header('Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet');
            header('Content-Disposition: attachment;filename="' . $filename . '"');
            header('Cache-Control: max-age=0');

            $writer = new Xlsx($spreadsheet);
            $writer->save('php://output');
            exit;

        } catch (Exception $e) {
            show_error('Gagal mengekspor file Excel: ' . $e->getMessage());
        }
    }

    /**
     * Helper: Parse teks referensi RPS menjadi array mapping nomor referensi
     */
    private function parse_reference_map_for_excel($ref_text)
    {
        $ref_map = [];
        $ref_short_map = [];
        if (empty($ref_text)) return [$ref_map, $ref_short_map];

        if (preg_match('/<[a-z]/i', $ref_text)) {
            $ref_text = preg_replace('/<\/(?:p|li|tr|div)>/i', "\n", $ref_text);
            $ref_text = strip_tags($ref_text);
        }
        $r_lines = explode("\n", str_replace("\r", "", $ref_text));
        $r_idx = 1;
        foreach ($r_lines as $r_line) {
            $r_trim = trim($r_line);
            if ($r_trim === '' || preg_match('/^(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:DAFTAR REFERENSI|REFERENSI|PUSTAKA)/i', $r_trim)) continue;

            $num = $r_idx;
            $content = $r_trim;
            if (preg_match('/^(\d+)[\.\)]\s*(.*)$/', $r_trim, $m_r)) {
                $num = (int)$m_r[1];
                $content = trim($m_r[2]);
            } elseif (preg_match('/^[\-\*•\x{2022}]\s*(.*)$/u', $r_trim, $m_r)) {
                $content = trim($m_r[1]);
                $content = preg_replace('/^\d+[\.\)]\s*/', '', $content);
            }

            if (!empty($content)) {
                $clean_c = preg_replace('/^[\d\.\)\-\*•\s]+/', '', $content);
                $clean_c = preg_replace('/[*_]/', '', $clean_c);
                $clean_c = trim($clean_c);
                $ref_map[$num] = $clean_c;

                // Format short representation: Author (Year): Title
                if (preg_match('/^(.*?)\s*\((\d{4}[a-z]?)\)\s*[\.:,]\s*(.*)$/u', $clean_c, $m_apa)) {
                    $raw_auth = trim($m_apa[1]);
                    $year = $m_apa[2];
                    $rest = trim($m_apa[3]);

                    $auth_display = '';
                    if (preg_match('/^([A-Za-z\x{00C0}-\x{017F}\-\'\s]+?)(?:,|\.|\s*&)/u', $raw_auth, $m_sur)) {
                        $auth_display = trim($m_sur[1]);
                        if (stripos($raw_auth, '&') !== false || stripos($raw_auth, 'and') !== false || stripos($raw_auth, 'et al') !== false) {
                            $auth_display .= ' et al.';
                        }
                    } else {
                        $auth_display = $raw_auth;
                    }

                    $rest_parts = explode('.', $rest);
                    $raw_title = trim($rest_parts[0]);
                    if (empty($raw_title) && isset($rest_parts[1])) {
                        $raw_title = trim($rest_parts[1]);
                    }
                    if (empty($raw_title)) $raw_title = $rest;

                    if (mb_strlen($raw_title) > 45) {
                        $raw_title = mb_substr($raw_title, 0, 43) . '...';
                    }
                    $stitle = $auth_display . ' (' . $year . '): ' . $raw_title;
                } elseif (preg_match('/^(.*?)\s*["“‘]([^"”’]+)["”’](.*)$/u', $clean_c, $m_q)) {
                    $raw_auth = trim($m_q[1]);
                    $raw_title = trim($m_q[2]);
                    if (mb_strlen($raw_title) > 45) {
                        $raw_title = mb_substr($raw_title, 0, 43) . '...';
                    }
                    $auth_display = !empty($raw_auth) ? trim($raw_auth, ' .,:') . ': ' : '';
                    $stitle = $auth_display . $raw_title;
                } else {
                    $first_part = explode('.', $clean_c)[0];
                    if (mb_strlen($first_part) > 45) {
                        $first_part = mb_substr($first_part, 0, 43) . '...';
                    }
                    $stitle = $first_part;
                }

                $ref_short_map[$num] = $stitle;
                $r_idx++;
            }
        }
        return [$ref_map, $ref_short_map];
    }

    /**
     * Helper: Format kolom Sumber Belajar untuk Excel (resolusi [Ref 1, Ref 2] menjadi referensi lengkap/ringkas)
     */
    private function format_sumber_belajar_excel($raw_text, $ref_map = [], $ref_short_map = [])
    {
        if (empty($raw_text)) return '';
        $clean = trim(strip_tags((string)$raw_text));
        $clean = html_entity_decode($clean, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8');
        $clean = preg_replace('/\*\*(.*?)\*\*/', '$1', $clean);
        $clean = preg_replace('/[*_]/', '', $clean);

        // Jika hanya berisi nomor rujukan murni seperti "[1]", "[1, 2]", "[Ref 1]", "[Ref 1, Ref 2]", "Ref 1; Ref 2"
        if (preg_match('/^(?:\[?\s*(?:Ref(?:erensi)?|Pustaka)?\s*\d{1,2}\s*\]?[\s,;–\-\/]*)+$/i', $clean)) {
            if (preg_match_all('/\b(\d{1,2})\b/', $clean, $matches)) {
                $nums = array_unique($matches[1]);
                if (!empty($nums)) {
                    $items = [];
                    foreach ($nums as $n) {
                        $n_int = (int)$n;
                        if (isset($ref_short_map[$n_int])) {
                            $items[] = "[Ref {$n_int}] " . $ref_short_map[$n_int];
                        } elseif (isset($ref_map[$n_int])) {
                            $items[] = "[Ref {$n_int}] " . $ref_map[$n_int];
                        } else {
                            $items[] = "[Ref {$n_int}]";
                        }
                    }
                    return implode("\n", $items);
                }
            }
        }

        return $clean;
    }

    /**
     * Export Roadmap Pembelajaran format WBI into a beautifully formatted Excel file
     */
    public function export_roadmap_excel()
    {
        $roadmap_raw = $this->input->post('roadmap_json');
        $kode_mk     = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9_\-]/', '', $this->input->post('kode_mk') ?: 'MK');
        $nama_mk     = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9_\-]/', '_', $this->input->post('nama_mk') ?: 'Roadmap');

        $data = json_decode($roadmap_raw, true);
        if (!is_array($data) || empty($data['modules'])) {
            show_error('Data roadmap tidak valid untuk diekspor ke Excel.');
            return;
        }

        try {
            $spreadsheet = new Spreadsheet();
            $sheet = $spreadsheet->getActiveSheet();
            $sheet->setTitle('Roadmap WBI');
            $sheet->setShowGridLines(true);

            // Palette warna pastel per modul WBI
            $palette = ['DBEAFE', 'DCFCE7', 'FFEDD5', 'F3E8FF', 'CFFAFE', 'FFE4E6', 'E0E7FF'];
            $color_uts_uas = 'FEF08A'; // Kuning terang resmi WBI

            $learning_outcome = strtoupper($data['learning_outcome'] ?? ('ROADMAP PEMBELAJARAN ' . str_replace('_', ' ', $nama_mk)));
            $modules = $data['modules'];

            // Baris 1-2: Judul Learning Outcome (B1 s.d Q2)
            $sheet->setCellValue('A1', 'LEARNING OUTCOME');
            $sheet->mergeCells('A1:A2');
            $sheet->getStyle('A1')->getFont()->setBold(true)->setSize(10);
            $sheet->getStyle('A1')->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_CENTER);
            $sheet->getStyle('A1:A2')->getFill()->setFillType(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Fill::FILL_SOLID)->getStartColor()->setARGB('E2E8F0');

            $sheet->setCellValue('B1', $learning_outcome);
            $sheet->mergeCells('B1:Q2');
            $sheet->getStyle('B1')->getFont()->setBold(true)->setSize(11);
            $sheet->getStyle('B1')->getAlignment()->setHorizontal(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::HORIZONTAL_CENTER);
            $sheet->getStyle('B1')->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_CENTER);
            $sheet->getStyle('B1')->getAlignment()->setWrapText(true);
            $sheet->getStyle('B1:Q2')->getFill()->setFillType(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Fill::FILL_SOLID)->getStartColor()->setARGB('F1F5F9');

            // Kolom R (Vertikal Nama Mata Kuliah)
            $sheet->setCellValue('R1', str_replace('_', ' ', $nama_mk));
            $sheet->mergeCells('R1:R8');
            $sheet->getStyle('R1')->getFont()->setBold(true)->setSize(12);
            $sheet->getStyle('R1')->getAlignment()->setTextRotation(90);
            $sheet->getStyle('R1')->getAlignment()->setHorizontal(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::HORIZONTAL_CENTER);
            $sheet->getStyle('R1')->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_CENTER);
            $sheet->getStyle('R1:R8')->getFill()->setFillType(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Fill::FILL_SOLID)->getStartColor()->setARGB('E2E8F0');

            // Label Baris Kolom A
            $row_labels = [
                3 => 'Module',
                4 => 'Output',
                5 => 'Concept',
                6 => 'Indicators',
                7 => 'Learning Strategy',
                8 => 'Meeting'
            ];

            foreach ($row_labels as $r_idx => $lbl) {
                $sheet->setCellValue('A' . $r_idx, strtoupper($lbl));
                $sheet->getStyle('A' . $r_idx)->getFont()->setBold(true)->setSize(10);
                $sheet->getStyle('A' . $r_idx)->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_CENTER);
                $sheet->getStyle('A' . $r_idx)->getFill()->setFillType(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Fill::FILL_SOLID)->getStartColor()->setARGB('E2E8F0');
            }

            // Pertemuan 1 s.d 16 pada Baris 8 (Kolom B s.d Q)
            for ($m_num = 1; $m_num <= 16; $m_num++) {
                $col_letter = \PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Cell\Coordinate::stringFromColumnIndex($m_num + 1);
                $label_m = $m_num;
                if ($m_num == 8) $label_m = "8 (UTS)";
                if ($m_num == 16) $label_m = "16 (UAS)";

                $sheet->setCellValue($col_letter . '8', $label_m);
                $sheet->getStyle($col_letter . '8')->getFont()->setBold(true)->setSize(10);
                $sheet->getStyle($col_letter . '8')->getAlignment()->setHorizontal(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::HORIZONTAL_CENTER);
                $sheet->getStyle($col_letter . '8')->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_CENTER);
            }

            // Render Tiap Modul
            $mod_color_idx = 0;
            foreach ($modules as $mod) {
                $start_m = max(1, min(16, (int)($mod['start_meeting'] ?? 1)));
                $end_m   = max(1, min(16, (int)($mod['end_meeting'] ?? $start_m)));
                if ($end_m < $start_m) $end_m = $start_m;

                $start_col = \PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Cell\Coordinate::stringFromColumnIndex($start_m + 1);
                $end_col   = \PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Cell\Coordinate::stringFromColumnIndex($end_m + 1);

                $is_uts_uas = ($start_m == 8 && $end_m == 8) || ($start_m == 16 && $end_m == 16) || stripos($mod['module_name'] ?? '', 'UTS') !== false || stripos($mod['module_name'] ?? '', 'UAS') !== false;

                $bg_color = $is_uts_uas ? $color_uts_uas : ($palette[$mod_color_idx % count($palette)]);
                if (!$is_uts_uas) $mod_color_idx++;

                // 1. Module Name (Row 3)
                $sheet->setCellValue($start_col . '3', $mod['module_name'] ?? 'Modul');
                if ($start_col !== $end_col) $sheet->mergeCells("{$start_col}3:{$end_col}3");
                $sheet->getStyle("{$start_col}3")->getFont()->setBold(true)->setSize(10);
                $sheet->getStyle("{$start_col}3")->getAlignment()->setHorizontal(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::HORIZONTAL_CENTER);

                // 2. Output (Row 4)
                $sheet->setCellValue($start_col . '4', $mod['output'] ?? '');
                if ($start_col !== $end_col) $sheet->mergeCells("{$start_col}4:{$end_col}4");

                // 3. Concept (Row 5)
                $sheet->setCellValue($start_col . '5', $mod['concept'] ?? '');
                if ($start_col !== $end_col) $sheet->mergeCells("{$start_col}5:{$end_col}5");

                // 4. Indicators (Row 6)
                $sheet->setCellValue($start_col . '6', $mod['indicators'] ?? '');
                if ($start_col !== $end_col) $sheet->mergeCells("{$start_col}6:{$end_col}6");

                // 5. Strategy (Row 7)
                $sheet->setCellValue($start_col . '7', $mod['strategy'] ?? '');
                if ($start_col !== $end_col) $sheet->mergeCells("{$start_col}7:{$end_col}7");

                // Styling blok modul (Row 3-7)
                $range = "{$start_col}3:{$end_col}7";
                $sheet->getStyle($range)->getFill()->setFillType(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Fill::FILL_SOLID)->getStartColor()->setARGB($bg_color);
                $sheet->getStyle($range)->getAlignment()->setVertical(\PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Alignment::VERTICAL_TOP);
                $sheet->getStyle($range)->getAlignment()->setWrapText(true);
            }

            // Beri Border Tipis Hitam ke Seluruh Tabel (A1 s.d R8)
            $border_style = [
                'borders' => [
                    'allBorders' => [
                        'borderStyle' => \PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Style\Border::BORDER_THIN,
                        'color' => ['argb' => '334155'],
                    ],
                ],
            ];
            $sheet->getStyle('A1:R8')->applyFromArray($border_style);

            // Set Lebar Kolom
            $sheet->getColumnDimension('A')->setWidth(18);
            for ($c = 2; $c <= 17; $c++) {
                $letter = \PhpOffice\PhpSpreadsheet\Cell\Coordinate::stringFromColumnIndex($c);
                $sheet->getColumnDimension($letter)->setWidth(20);
            }
            $sheet->getColumnDimension('R')->setWidth(8);

            // Set Tinggi Baris
            $sheet->getRowDimension(1)->setRowHeight(20);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(2)->setRowHeight(20);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(3)->setRowHeight(30);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(4)->setRowHeight(80);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(5)->setRowHeight(80);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(6)->setRowHeight(80);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(7)->setRowHeight(60);
            $sheet->getRowDimension(8)->setRowHeight(25);

            $filename = "Roadmap_WBI_{$kode_mk}_{$nama_mk}.xlsx";

            header('Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet');
            header('Content-Disposition: attachment;filename="' . $filename . '"');
            header('Cache-Control: max-age=0');

            $writer = new Xlsx($spreadsheet);
            $writer->save('php://output');
            exit;

        } catch (Exception $e) {
            show_error('Gagal membuat file Excel Roadmap: ' . $e->getMessage());
        }
    }

    /**
     * AJAX: Simpan hasil luaran RPS OBE ke tabel siakad_rps_obe & siakad_rps_obe_detail
     */
    public function ajax_save_to_db()
    {
        $this->output->set_content_type('application/json');
        $id_ptk = $this->session->userdata('id_ptk');
        $user = $this->ion_auth->user()->row();
        $user_email = ($user && !empty($user->email)) ? $user->email : ($this->session->userdata('email') ?: ($this->session->userdata('identity') ?: ($id_ptk ?: 'dosen')));

        $id_rps         = (int)$this->input->post('id_rps');
        $id_mk          = trim($this->input->post('id_mk'));
        $kode_mk        = trim($this->input->post('kode_mk'));
        $nm_mk          = trim($this->input->post('nm_mk') ?: $this->input->post('mata_kuliah'));
        $sks_mk         = (int)($this->input->post('sks') ?: 3);
        $semester       = trim($this->input->post('semester'));
        $dosen          = trim($this->input->post('dosen'));
        $tanggal_rps    = trim($this->input->post('tanggal_rps') ?: '');
        $cpl            = trim($this->input->post('cpl'));
        $tujuan_belajar = trim($this->input->post('tujuan_belajar'));
        $deskripsi      = $this->_clean_deskripsi_text($this->input->post('deskripsi_mata_kuliah'));
        $prasyarat      = trim($this->input->post('prasyarat_mata_kuliah'));
        $referensi      = $this->_clean_referensi_text($this->input->post('referensi'));
        $raw_ai_output  = trim($this->input->post('raw_ai_output'));
        $ai_provider    = trim($this->input->post('ai_provider') ?: 'gemini');
        $ai_model       = trim($this->input->post('ai_model') ?: '');

        // Auto-extract sections from raw_ai_output if not explicitly provided
        if (!empty($raw_ai_output)) {
            $sec_prefix = '(?:^|\n)(?:[#*`\s]*)(?:(?:BAGIAN|BAB|SEKSI|POIN|BAG)\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z]+(?:\.[0-9A-Za-z]+)*[\.\:\)]\s*)?';
            $lookahead_prefix = '\n+(?:[#*`\s]*)(?:(?:BAGIAN|BAB|SEKSI|POIN|BAG)\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z]+(?:\.[0-9A-Za-z]+)*[\.\:\)]\s*)?';

            // 1. CPL
            if (empty($cpl) || trim($cpl) === '') {
                if (preg_match('/' . $sec_prefix . '(?:CAPAIAN PEMBELAJARAN LULUSAN|CPL\b)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=' . $lookahead_prefix . '(?:TUJUAN BELAJAR|CPMK|CAPAIAN PEMBELAJARAN MATA KULIAH|DESKRIPSI|REFERENSI|DETAIL RENCANA)|\Z)/i', $raw_ai_output, $m)) {
                    $clean_cpl_extracted = trim($m[1]);
                    $clean_cpl_extracted = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*`\s]*)(?:(?:BAGIAN|BAB|SEKSI|POIN|BAG)\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z]+(?:\.[0-9A-Za-z]+)*[\.\:\)]\s*)?(?:CAPAIAN PEMBELAJARAN MATA KULIAH|CPMK|TUJUAN BELAJAR|MATRIKS\s*KORELASI|MATRIKS\s*DISTRIBUSI|BLUEPRINT\s*ASESMEN|RUMUSAN\s*CPMK)[^\n]*\n+[\s\S]*$/i', '', $clean_cpl_extracted);
                    $clean_cpl_extracted = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)\s*\|[^\n]+\|[\s\S]*$/i', '', $clean_cpl_extracted);
                    $cpl = trim($clean_cpl_extracted);
                }
            }

            // 2. CPMK / Tujuan Belajar & Matriks Asesmen
            if (empty($tujuan_belajar) || trim($tujuan_belajar) === '') {
                if (preg_match('/' . $sec_prefix . '(?:TUJUAN BELAJAR|CPMK\b|CAPAIAN PEMBELAJARAN MATA KULIAH|MATRIKS KORELASI CPMK)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=' . $lookahead_prefix . '(?:DESKRIPSI|RINGKASAN MATA KULIAH|REFERENSI|DAFTAR PUSTAKA|DETAIL RENCANA)|\Z)/i', $raw_ai_output, $m)) {
                    $tujuan_belajar = trim($m[1]);
                }
            }

            // 3. Deskripsi Singkat & Prasyarat
            if (empty($deskripsi) || trim($deskripsi) === '') {
                if (preg_match('/' . $sec_prefix . '(?:DESKRIPSI SINGKAT MATA KULIAH & PRASYARAT|DESKRIPSI SINGKAT|DESKRIPSI MATA KULIAH|DESKRIPSI|RINGKASAN MATA KULIAH)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=' . $lookahead_prefix . '(?:DAFTAR REFERENSI|REFERENSI|PUSTAKA|DETAIL RENCANA|TABEL|MATRIKS)|\Z)/i', $raw_ai_output, $m)) {
                    $desk_full = trim($m[1]);
                    if (empty($prasyarat) || $prasyarat === 'Tidak ada' || preg_match('/^\s*[\d\.\*\-]*\s*tidak ada/i', $prasyarat)) {
                        if (preg_match('/(?:^|\n)\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:[\-\*•`\s]*)(?:PRASYARAT|MATA KULIAH PRASYARAT)(?:\s*\([^\)]*\))?(?:\*{1,2})?[:\s\-]*\n*([^\n\r]+)/i', $desk_full, $m_pra)) {
                            $prasyarat = trim($m_pra[1]);
                        }
                    }
                    $desk_full = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:[\-\*•`\s]*)(?:PRASYARAT|MATA KULIAH PRASYARAT)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $desk_full);
                    $desk_full = preg_replace('/^(?:\s*\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:[\-\*•`#\s]*)(?:DESKRIPSI\s*(?:SINGKAT)?(?:\s*MATA\s*KULIAH)?|RINGKASAN\s*MATA\s*KULIAH)(?:\*{1,2})?[:\s\-]*\n*/i', '', trim($desk_full));
                    $desk_full = preg_replace('/^(?:\s*\d+[\.\)]\s*|\s*[\-\*•]\s*)+/u', '', trim($desk_full));
                    $desk_full = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*_`\s]*)[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]{1,10}(?:[#*_`\s]*)$/i', '', trim($desk_full));
                    $deskripsi = trim($desk_full);
                }
            }

            // 4. Prasyarat Mata Kuliah (jika terpisah)
            if (empty($prasyarat) || trim($prasyarat) === '') {
                if (preg_match('/' . $sec_prefix . '(?:PRASYARAT|MATA KULIAH PRASYARAT)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=' . $lookahead_prefix . '(?:DAFTAR REFERENSI|REFERENSI|PUSTAKA|DETAIL RENCANA)|\Z)/i', $raw_ai_output, $m)) {
                    $prasyarat = trim($m[1]);
                }
            }

            // 5. Referensi / Daftar Pustaka
            if (empty($referensi) || trim($referensi) === '') {
                if (preg_match('/' . $sec_prefix . '(?:DAFTAR REFERENSI|REFERENSI|DAFTAR PUSTAKA|PUSTAKA)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=' . $lookahead_prefix . '(?:DETAIL RENCANA|RENCANA PEMBELAJARAN|TABEL|MATRIKS|DISTRIBUSI BOBOT|PENILAIAN)|\Z)/i', $raw_ai_output, $m)) {
                    $referensi = trim($m[1]);
                }
            }
        }

        // Bersihkan penanda draf/validasi agar dokumen resmi dan siap saji
        $clean_validation_fn = function($str) {
            if (empty($str)) return $str;
            $str = preg_replace('/`?\s*\[(?:PERLU|BUTUH)\s+VALIDASI[^\]]*\]\s*`?/i', '', $str);
            $str = preg_replace('/`?\s*\[ASUMSI\s+DEFAULT[^\]]*\]\s*`?/i', '', $str);
            return trim($str);
        };
        $cpl            = $clean_validation_fn($cpl);
        $tujuan_belajar = $clean_validation_fn($tujuan_belajar);

        // Sanitize Deskripsi: hapus bullet/nomor 1.
        $deskripsi = $clean_validation_fn($deskripsi);
        $deskripsi = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:[\-\*•`\s]*)(?:PRASYARAT|MATA KULIAH PRASYARAT)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $deskripsi);
        $deskripsi = preg_replace('/^(?:\s*\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:[\-\*•`#\s]*)(?:DESKRIPSI\s*(?:SINGKAT)?(?:\s*MATA\s*KULIAH)?|RINGKASAN\s*MATA\s*KULIAH)(?:\*{1,2})?[:\s\-]*\n*/i', '', trim($deskripsi));
        $deskripsi = preg_replace('/^(?:\s*\d+[\.\)]\s*|\s*[\-\*•]\s*)+/u', '', trim($deskripsi));
        $deskripsi = trim($deskripsi);

        // Sanitize Prasyarat: hapus 1. * Tidak ada
        $prasyarat = $clean_validation_fn($prasyarat);
        $prasyarat = preg_replace('/^(?:\s*\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:[\-\*•`#\s]*)(?:PRASYARAT|MATA KULIAH PRASYARAT)(?:\s*\([^\)]*\))?(?:\*{1,2})?[:\s\-]*\n*/i', '', $prasyarat);
        $prasyarat = preg_replace('/^(?:\s*\d+[\.\)]\s*|\s*[\-\*•]\s*)+/u', '', trim($prasyarat));
        $prasyarat = trim($prasyarat);
        $clean_pra_check = strtolower(preg_replace('/[^a-z]/', '', $prasyarat));
        if (empty($prasyarat) || $clean_pra_check === 'tidakada' || $clean_pra_check === 'none' || $clean_pra_check === '' || $prasyarat === '-') {
            $prasyarat = 'Tidak ada';
        }
        $referensi      = $clean_validation_fn($referensi);

        // Sanitize boundary agar tidak ada kebocoran antar bagian:
        if (!empty($cpl)) {
            $cpl = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]+\s*)?(?:TUJUAN BELAJAR|CPMK|CAPAIAN PEMBELAJARAN MATA KULIAH|MATRIKS KORELASI)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $cpl);
            $cpl = trim($cpl);
        }
        if (!empty($tujuan_belajar)) {
            $tujuan_belajar = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]+\s*)?(?:DESKRIPSI|RINGKASAN|DAFTAR REFERENSI|REFERENSI|DETAIL RENCANA)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $tujuan_belajar);
            $tujuan_belajar = trim($tujuan_belajar);
        }
        if (!empty($deskripsi)) {
            $deskripsi = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]+\s*)?(?:DAFTAR REFERENSI|REFERENSI|PUSTAKA|DETAIL RENCANA)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $deskripsi);
            $deskripsi = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*_`\s]*)[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]{1,10}(?:[#*_`\s]*)$/i', '', trim($deskripsi));
            $deskripsi = trim($deskripsi);
        }
        if (!empty($referensi)) {
            // Potong jika ada judul bagian lanjutan
            $referensi = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]+\s*)?(?:DETAIL RENCANA|RENCANA PEMBELAJARAN|TABEL\s*(?:16\s*)?PERTEMUAN|DISTRIBUSI BOBOT|PENILAIAN|DESKRIPSI SINGKAT|MATRIKS|BLUEPRINT)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $referensi);
            // Potong jika ada raw markdown table 16 pertemuan / asesmen yang ikut tersedot
            $referensi = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)\s*\|{1,2}(?:\s*Minggu|\s*Temu|\s*No|\s*1\s*\||\s*Sub-CPMK|\s*CPMK|\s*Bentuk|\s*Kriteria|\s*ETS|\s*UTS|\s*EAS|\s*UAS)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $referensi);
            $referensi = trim($referensi);
        }

        // ⚠️ VALIDASI MUTLAK: Daftar Referensi TIDAK BOLEH KOSONG / BELUM DIISI saat menyimpan RPS
        if (empty($referensi) || $referensi === '-' || $referensi === 'Tidak ada' || preg_match('/(?:belum\s+diisi|wajib\s+(?:menginput|memasukkan)|\[Referensi\s+belum)/i', $referensi)) {
            echo json_encode([
                'status' => false,
                'msg'    => 'Gagal menyimpan: Daftar Referensi (Bagian 5) masih kosong! Dosen wajib menginput daftar buku rujukan/referensi perkuliahan melalui kolom prompt instruksi terlebih dahulu sebelum menyimpan RPS.'
            ]);
            return;
        }

        $manfaat_mk     = trim($this->input->post('manfaat_mata_kuliah'));
        $cp_mk          = trim($this->input->post('cp_mata_kuliah'));
        $analisis_inst  = trim($this->input->post('analisis_instruksional'));
        $strategi       = trim($this->input->post('strategi_perkuliahan'));
        $materi_bacaan  = trim($this->input->post('materi_bahan_bacaan'));
        if (!empty($materi_bacaan)) {
            $materi_bacaan = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[0-9A-Za-z\.\-_]+\s*)?(?:DETAIL RENCANA|RENCANA PEMBELAJARAN|TABEL\s*(?:16\s*)?PERTEMUAN|DISTRIBUSI BOBOT|PENILAIAN|DESKRIPSI SINGKAT|MATRIKS|BLUEPRINT|TUGAS|KRITERIA)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $materi_bacaan);
            $materi_bacaan = preg_replace('/(?:\n+|\A)\s*\|{1,2}(?:\s*Minggu|\s*Temu|\s*No|\s*1\s*\||\s*Sub-CPMK|\s*CPMK|\s*Bentuk|\s*Kriteria|\s*ETS|\s*UTS|\s*EAS|\s*UAS)[\s\S]*$/i', '', $materi_bacaan);
            $materi_bacaan = trim($materi_bacaan);
        }
        $tugas_tugas    = trim($this->input->post('tugas_tugas'));
        $kontrak_eval   = trim($this->input->post('kontrak_kriteria_penilaian'));
        $jadwal_kuliah  = trim($this->input->post('jadwal_perkuliahan'));
        $tata_tertib    = trim($this->input->post('tata_kelola_perkuliahan'));

        // Rancangan Tugas
        $tugas_ke       = trim($this->input->post('tugas_ke'));
        $tugas_minggu   = trim($this->input->post('tugas_minggu_ke'));
        $tujuan_tugas   = trim($this->input->post('tujuan_tugas'));
        $tugas_obyek    = trim($this->input->post('tugas_obyek_garapan'));
        $tugas_batasan  = trim($this->input->post('tugas_batasan'));
        $tugas_metode   = trim($this->input->post('tugas_metode'));
        $tugas_luaran   = trim($this->input->post('tugas_luaran'));
        $tugas_rapi     = trim($this->input->post('tugas_penilaian_kerapian'));
        $tugas_tepat    = trim($this->input->post('tugas_ketepatan'));

        $roadmap_json   = $this->input->post('roadmap_json');
        $matrix_json    = $this->input->post('matrix_json');
        $roadmap_md     = trim($this->input->post('roadmap_wbi_markdown'));
        $kontrak_md     = trim($this->input->post('kontrak_kuliah_markdown'));
        $tugas_md       = trim($this->input->post('rancangan_tugas_markdown'));
        $skenario_md    = trim($this->input->post('skenario_pembelajaran_markdown'));

        // Bersihkan roadmap markdown dari sisa blok JSON dan ekstrak roadmap_json jika belum ada
        if (!empty($roadmap_md)) {
            if (empty($roadmap_json) && preg_match('/(?:```(?:json_roadmap|json)?\s*)?(\{[\s\S]*?"modules"[\s\S]*?\})(?:\s*```)?/i', $roadmap_md, $rmj)) {
                $roadmap_json = trim($rmj[1]);
            }
            $roadmap_md = preg_replace('/```(?:json_roadmap|json)?\s*\{[\s\S]*?"modules"[\s\S]*?\}\s*```/is', '', $roadmap_md);
            $roadmap_md = preg_replace('/\{[\s\S]*?"learning_outcome"[\s\S]*?"modules"[\s\S]*?\}\s*$/is', '', $roadmap_md);
            $roadmap_md = trim($roadmap_md);
        }

        // 1. Ekstrak bagian-bagian Kontrak Kuliah jika kontrak_md dikirim
        if (!empty($kontrak_md)) {
            if (empty($manfaat_mk) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?MANFAAT MATA KULIAH[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:TUJUAN BELAJAR|CP MATA KULIAH|CPMK|ANALISIS|STRATEGI|MATERI|TUGAS|KRITERIA|JADWAL|TATA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $manfaat_mk = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($cp_mk) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:TUJUAN BELAJAR|CP MATA KULIAH|CPMK\b)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:ANALISIS|STRATEGI|MATERI|TUGAS|KRITERIA|JADWAL|TATA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $cp_mk = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($strategi) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?STRATEGI[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:MATERI|BAHAN BACAAN|REFERENSI|TUGAS|KRITERIA|JADWAL|TATA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $strategi = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($materi_bacaan) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:MATERI BACAAN|MATERI\/BAHAN BACAAN|BAHAN BACAAN|REFERENSI)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:TUGAS|KRITERIA|BOBOT|JADWAL|TATA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $materi_bacaan = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($tugas_tugas) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?TUGAS[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:KRITERIA|BOBOT|PENILAIAN|JADWAL|TATA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $tugas_tugas = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($kontrak_eval) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:KRITERIA & BOBOT PENILAIAN|KRITERIA PENILAIAN|BOBOT PENILAIAN|PENILAIAN)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:JADWAL|RENCANA 16|TATA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $kontrak_eval = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($jadwal_kuliah) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:JADWAL KULIAH|JADWAL PERKULIAHAN|RENCANA 16 MINGGU)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:TATA TERTIB|TATA KELOLA))|\Z)/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $jadwal_kuliah = trim($km[1]);
            }
            if (empty($tata_tertib) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:TATA TERTIB|TATA KELOLA PERKULIAHAN)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)$/i', $kontrak_md, $km)) {
                $tata_tertib = trim($km[1]);
            }
        }

        // 2. Fallback sinkronisasi dari RPS jika Kontrak Kuliah belum di-generate tersendiri atau butuh alignment
        if (empty($cp_mk)) {
            $cp_mk = $tujuan_belajar;
        }
        if (empty($materi_bacaan)) {
            $materi_bacaan = $referensi;
        }
        if (empty($kontrak_eval) && !empty($raw_ai_output)) {
            if (preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:TUJUAN BELAJAR|CPMK|MATRIKS KORELASI CPMK|BLUEPRINT ASESMEN)[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:DESKRIPSI|REFERENSI|DETAIL RENCANA))|\Z)/i', $raw_ai_output, $rm)) {
                $kontrak_eval = trim($rm[1]);
            }
        }
        if (empty($manfaat_mk)) {
            $manfaat_mk = "Mata kuliah ini membekali mahasiswa dengan penguasaan kompetensi analitis dan praktis yang esensial, mendukung profil lulusan Program Studi, serta membentuk kesiapan profesional di dunia industri dan bisnis.";
        }
        if (empty($strategi)) {
            $strategi = "Perkuliahan diselenggarakan dengan pendekatan Student-Centered Learning (SCL) yang mengintegrasikan metode Case Method, Project-Based Learning, diskusi interaktif, dan simulasi praktikum.";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_tugas)) {
            $tugas_tugas = "Tugas terstruktur terdiri dari analisis studi kasus industri, tugas kelompok mini proyek, kuis berkala, dan evaluasi hasil belajar mandiri.";
        }
        if (empty($tata_tertib)) {
            $tata_tertib = "- Kehadiran minimal mahasiswa adalah 75% dari total tatap muka untuk berhak mengikuti Ujian Akhir Semester (UAS).\n- Toleransi keterlambatan maksimal 15 menit.\n- Berpakaian rapi, sopan, dan mematuhi etika akademik Politeknik Wilmar Bisnis Indonesia.\n- Plagiarisme atau kecurangan dalam ujian/tugas berakibat sanksi nilai E.";
        }

        // Jika $kontrak_md masih kosong, buat otomatis dokumen markdown lengkap agar tersimpan dan selaras 100%
        if (empty($kontrak_md)) {
            $kontrak_md = "# KONTRAK PEMBELAJARAN\n\n"
                        . "### **" . $nm_mk . (!empty($kode_mk) ? " ({$kode_mk})" : "") . "**\n\n"
                        . "- **Program Studi:** " . ($this->input->post('prodi') ?: 'Politeknik Wilmar Bisnis Indonesia') . "\n"
                        . "- **Bobot SKS:** " . $sks_mk . " SKS\n"
                        . "- **Semester:** " . $semester . "\n"
                        . "- **Dosen Pengampu:** " . $dosen . "\n\n"
                        . "## 1. DESKRIPSI MATA KULIAH\n" . ($deskripsi ?: '-') . "\n\n"
                        . "## 2. MANFAAT MATA KULIAH\n" . $manfaat_mk . "\n\n"
                        . "## 3. CP MATA KULIAH (CPMK)\n" . ($cp_mk ?: '-') . "\n\n"
                        . "## 4. STRATEGI PERKULIAHAN\n" . $strategi . "\n\n"
                        . "## 5. MATERI / BAHAN BACAAN\n" . ($materi_bacaan ?: '-') . "\n\n"
                        . "## 6. TUGAS-TUGAS\n" . $tugas_tugas . "\n\n"
                        . "## 7. KRITERIA & BOBOT PENILAIAN\n" . ($kontrak_eval ?: "Penilaian mengacu pada Matriks Blueprint Asesmen RPS OBE dengan total bobot 100%.") . "\n\n"
                        . "## 8. TATA TERTIB & KETENTUAN PERKULIAHAN\n" . $tata_tertib . "\n";
        }

        // 3. Ekstrak bagian-bagian Rancangan Tugas jika tugas_md dikirim
        if (!empty($tugas_md)) {
            if (empty($tujuan_tugas) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?TUJUAN TUGAS[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:URAIAN|OBYEK|METODE|KRITERIA|JADWAL))|\Z)/i', $tugas_md, $tm)) {
                $tujuan_tugas = trim($tm[1]);
            }
            if (empty($tugas_obyek) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[a-d][\.\)]\s*)?Obyek Garapan[^\n]*[:\-]?\s*([^\n\r]+)/i', $tugas_md, $tm)) {
                $tugas_obyek = trim($tm[1]);
            }
            if (empty($tugas_batasan) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[a-d][\.\)]\s*)?Yang Harus Dikerjakan[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:[a-d][\.\)]\s*)?(?:Metode|Luaran|Kriteria))|\Z)/i', $tugas_md, $tm)) {
                $tugas_batasan = trim($tm[1]);
            }
            if (empty($tugas_metode) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[a-d][\.\)]\s*)?Metode[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:[a-d][\.\)]\s*)?(?:Luaran|Kriteria))|\Z)/i', $tugas_md, $tm)) {
                $tugas_metode = trim($tm[1]);
            }
            if (empty($tugas_luaran) && preg_match('/(?:^|\n)(?:[#*]{1,4}\s*)?(?:[a-d][\.\)]\s*)?Deskripsi Luaran[^\n]*\n+([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:\n+[#*]{1,4}\s*(?:\d+[\.\)]\s*)?(?:KRITERIA|RUBRIK|JADWAL))|\Z)/i', $tugas_md, $tm)) {
                $tugas_luaran = trim($tm[1]);
            }
        }

        // 4. Fallback sinkronisasi Rancangan Tugas dari RPS jika belum diisi
        if (empty($tujuan_tugas)) {
            $tujuan_tugas = !empty($cp_mk) ? $cp_mk : ("Mahasiswa mampu menganalisis studi kasus nyata, memecahkan masalah kontekstual berbasis data, dan menyusun laporan terstruktur sesuai Capaian Pembelajaran Mata Kuliah (CPMK) " . $nm_mk . ".");
        }
        if (empty($tugas_obyek)) {
            $tugas_obyek = "Studi kasus industri dan proyek implementasi praktis terkait topik materi " . $nm_mk . ".";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_batasan)) {
            $tugas_batasan = "1. Menganalisis permasalahan riil berdasarkan data dan literatur terkini.\n2. Menyusun alternatif solusi dan rekomendasi strategis secara sistematis.\n3. Format dokumen laporan standar SPMI (Font Times New Roman 12pt / Calibri 11pt, spasi 1.5, margin 4-3-3-3).";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_metode)) {
            $tugas_metode = "Pengerjaan berbasis Student-Centered Learning (Case Method / Project-Based Learning) dengan tahapan: observasi/pengumpulan data, analisis kelompok, penyusunan laporan, asistensi berkala, dan presentasi hasil.";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_luaran)) {
            $tugas_luaran = "Laporan Analisis Komprehensif (PDF), Ringkasan Eksekutif, dan Slide Presentasi Tugas.";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_rapi)) {
            $tugas_rapi = "Kerapian tata letak (layout), sistematika penulisan laporan, kesesuaian format standar SPMI, dan ketepatan waktu pengumpulan (deadline).";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_tepat)) {
            $tugas_tepat = "Kedalaman analisis masalah, ketepatan metodologi yang diterapkan, validitas sumber rujukan, dan kelayakan solusi/rekomendasi.";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_ke)) {
            $tugas_ke = "1";
        }
        if (empty($tugas_minggu)) {
            $tugas_minggu = "4 s.d. 7";
        }

        if (empty($tugas_md)) {
            $tugas_md = "# RANCANGAN TUGAS MAHASISWA\n\n"
                      . "### **" . $nm_mk . (!empty($kode_mk) ? " ({$kode_mk})" : "") . "**\n\n"
                      . "- **Program Studi:** " . ($this->input->post('prodi') ?: 'Politeknik Wilmar Bisnis Indonesia') . "\n"
                      . "- **Bobot SKS:** " . $sks_mk . " SKS\n"
                      . "- **Semester:** " . $semester . "\n"
                      . "- **Dosen Pengampu:** " . $dosen . "\n"
                      . "- **Tugas Ke / Minggu Ke:** " . $tugas_ke . " (" . $tugas_minggu . ")\n\n"
                      . "## 1. TUJUAN TUGAS\n" . $tujuan_tugas . "\n\n"
                      . "## 2. URAIAN TUGAS\n"
                      . "**a. Obyek Garapan:**\n" . $tugas_obyek . "\n\n"
                      . "**b. Yang Harus Dikerjakan & Batasan-batasan:**\n" . $tugas_batasan . "\n\n"
                      . "**c. Metode / Cara Pengerjaan:**\n" . $tugas_metode . "\n\n"
                      . "**d. Deskripsi Luaran Tugas:**\n" . $tugas_luaran . "\n\n"
                      . "## 3. KRITERIA PENILAIAN\n"
                      . "**a. Kerapian:**\n" . $tugas_rapi . "\n\n"
                      . "**b. Ketepatan / Kebenaran:**\n" . $tugas_tepat . "\n";
        }

        if (empty($nm_mk)) {
            echo json_encode(['status' => false, 'msg' => 'Nama Mata Kuliah wajib diisi.']);
            return;
        }

        $this->load->model('Rps_obe_model');

        // Auto resolve kaprodi_rps jika belum ada
        $kaprodi_rps = null;
        $id_sms_mk = null;
        if (!empty($id_mk)) {
            $mkr = $this->db->where('id_mk', $id_mk)->get('feeder_mata_kuliah')->row();
            if ($mkr) $id_sms_mk = $mkr->id_sms;
        }
        if (empty($id_sms_mk) && !empty($kode_mk)) {
            $mkr = $this->db->where('kode_mk', $kode_mk)->get('feeder_mata_kuliah')->row();
            if ($mkr) $id_sms_mk = $mkr->id_sms;
        }
        if (!empty($id_sms_mk)) {
            $kap = $this->db->where('id_sms', $id_sms_mk)->get('kaprodi')->row();
            if ($kap && !empty($kap->id_ptk)) {
                $kaprodi_rps = $kap->id_ptk;
            }
        }

        $cpmk_json_post   = $this->input->post('cpmk_json');
        $cpmk_status_post = $this->input->post('cpmk_status');

        $data_header = [
            'id_ptk'                     => $id_ptk,
            'id_mk'                      => $id_mk ?: null,
            'kode_mk'                    => $kode_mk,
            'nm_mk'                      => $nm_mk,
            'kaprodi_rps'                => $kaprodi_rps,
            'sks_mk'                     => $sks_mk,
            'sks_tm'                     => (int)($this->input->post('sks_tm') ?: $sks_mk),
            'sks_prak'                   => (int)($this->input->post('sks_prak') ?: 0),
            'semester'                   => $semester,
            'dosen_pengampu'             => $dosen,
            'deskripsi_mata_kuliah'      => $deskripsi,
            'prasyarat_mata_kuliah'      => $prasyarat,
            'cpl'                        => $cpl,
            'tujuan_belajar'             => $tujuan_belajar,
            'cpmk_json'                  => !empty($cpmk_json_post) ? (is_array($cpmk_json_post) ? json_encode($cpmk_json_post, JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE) : $cpmk_json_post) : null,
            'cpmk_status'                => !empty($cpmk_status_post) ? $cpmk_status_post : null,
            'referensi'                  => $referensi,
            'manfaat_mata_kuliah'        => $manfaat_mk,
            'cp_mata_kuliah'             => $cp_mk,
            'analisis_instruksional'     => $analisis_inst,
            'strategi_perkuliahan'       => $strategi,
            'materi_bahan_bacaan'        => $materi_bacaan,
            'tugas_tugas'                => $tugas_tugas,
            'kontrak_kriteria_penilaian' => $kontrak_eval,
            'jadwal_perkuliahan'         => $jadwal_kuliah,
            'tata_kelola_perkuliahan'    => $tata_tertib,
            'kontrak_kuliah_markdown'    => !empty($kontrak_md) ? $kontrak_md : null,
            'tugas_ke'                   => $tugas_ke,
            'tugas_minggu_ke'            => $tugas_minggu,
            'tujuan_tugas'               => $tujuan_tugas,
            'tugas_obyek_garapan'        => $tugas_obyek,
            'tugas_batasan'              => $tugas_batasan,
            'tugas_metode'               => $tugas_metode,
            'tugas_luaran'               => $tugas_luaran,
            'tugas_penilaian_kerapian'   => $tugas_rapi,
            'tugas_ketepatan'            => $tugas_tepat,
            'rancangan_tugas_markdown'       => !empty($tugas_md) ? $tugas_md : null,
            'roadmap_modul_json'             => !empty($roadmap_json) ? $roadmap_json : null,
            'roadmap_wbi_markdown'           => !empty($roadmap_md) ? $roadmap_md : null,
            'skenario_pembelajaran_markdown' => !empty($skenario_md) ? $skenario_md : null,
            'matrix_pertemuan_json'          => !empty($matrix_json) ? $matrix_json : null,
            'ai_provider'                    => $ai_provider,
            'ai_model'                       => $ai_model,
            'raw_ai_output'                  => $raw_ai_output,
            'id_status_pengajuan_rps'        => 1, // Draf
            'change_by'                      => $user_email,
            'change_date'                    => date('Y-m-d H:i:s')
        ];

        if (!empty($id_rps)) {
            $exist = $this->Rps_obe_model->get_by_id($id_rps);
            if ($exist && $exist->id_ptk == $id_ptk) {
                // Pertahankan tanggal atau perbarui jika dikirim
                if (!empty($tanggal_rps)) {
                    $data_header['tanggal_rps'] = $tanggal_rps;
                } elseif (empty($exist->tanggal_rps)) {
                    $data_header['tanggal_rps'] = date('Y-m-d');
                }
                // Jika markdown/JSON turunan kosong di POST tapi ada di DB, jangan timpa dengan null
                if (empty($data_header['cpmk_json']) && !empty($exist->cpmk_json)) {
                    $data_header['cpmk_json'] = $exist->cpmk_json;
                }
                if (empty($data_header['cpmk_status']) && !empty($exist->cpmk_status)) {
                    $data_header['cpmk_status'] = $exist->cpmk_status;
                }
                if (empty($data_header['roadmap_wbi_markdown']) && !empty($exist->roadmap_wbi_markdown)) {
                    $data_header['roadmap_wbi_markdown'] = $exist->roadmap_wbi_markdown;
                }
                if (empty($data_header['kontrak_kuliah_markdown']) && !empty($exist->kontrak_kuliah_markdown)) {
                    $data_header['kontrak_kuliah_markdown'] = $exist->kontrak_kuliah_markdown;
                }
                if (empty($data_header['rancangan_tugas_markdown']) && !empty($exist->rancangan_tugas_markdown)) {
                    $data_header['rancangan_tugas_markdown'] = $exist->rancangan_tugas_markdown;
                }
                if (empty($data_header['roadmap_modul_json']) && !empty($exist->roadmap_modul_json)) {
                    $data_header['roadmap_modul_json'] = $exist->roadmap_modul_json;
                }
                if (empty($data_header['skenario_pembelajaran_markdown']) && !empty($exist->skenario_pembelajaran_markdown)) {
                    $data_header['skenario_pembelajaran_markdown'] = $exist->skenario_pembelajaran_markdown;
                }

                $this->Rps_obe_model->update(['id_rps' => $id_rps], $data_header);
                $saved_id = $id_rps;
            } else {
                $data_header['create_by']   = $user_email;
                $data_header['create_date'] = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
                $data_header['tanggal_rps'] = !empty($tanggal_rps) ? $tanggal_rps : date('Y-m-d');
                $saved_id = $this->Rps_obe_model->save($data_header);
            }
        } else {
            $data_header['create_by']   = $user_email;
            $data_header['create_date'] = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
            $data_header['tanggal_rps'] = !empty($tanggal_rps) ? $tanggal_rps : date('Y-m-d');
            $saved_id = $this->Rps_obe_model->save($data_header);
        }

        // Simpan rincian 16 pertemuan jika ada
        $details_data = [];
        if (!empty($matrix_json)) {
            $details_data = json_decode($matrix_json, true);
        }
        if ((empty($details_data) || !is_array($details_data)) && !empty($raw_ai_output)) {
            $sks_tm_val   = (int)($this->input->post('sks_tm') ?: $sks_mk);
            $sks_prak_val = (int)($this->input->post('sks_prak') ?: 0);
            $details_data = $this->_parse_markdown_table_to_matrix($raw_ai_output, $sks_mk, $sks_tm_val, $sks_prak_val);
        }

        if (!empty($details_data) && is_array($details_data)) {
            $this->Rps_obe_model->save_details($saved_id, $details_data);
        }

        echo json_encode([
            'status'  => true,
            'id_rps'  => $saved_id,
            'msg'     => 'Seluruh dokumen (RPS, Roadmap, Kontrak Kuliah, Rancangan Tugas, & Skenario Pertemuan/BAP) berhasil disimpan ke database.'
        ]);
    }

    private function _resolve_prodi_for_rps($row)
    {
        if (!$row) return '';
        $prodi = '';
        if (!empty($row->id_mk)) {
            $mk = $this->db->query("SELECT COALESCE(NULLIF(s.nm_lemb, ''), (SELECT s2.nm_lemb FROM feeder_kelas_kuliah kk JOIN sms s2 ON s2.id_sms = kk.id_sms WHERE kk.id_mk = mk.id_mk LIMIT 1), '') as nm_prodi FROM feeder_mata_kuliah mk LEFT JOIN sms s ON s.id_sms = mk.id_sms WHERE mk.id_mk = ? LIMIT 1", [$row->id_mk])->row();
            if ($mk && !empty($mk->nm_prodi)) $prodi = $mk->nm_prodi;
        }
        if (empty($prodi) && !empty($row->kode_mk)) {
            $mk = $this->db->query("SELECT COALESCE(NULLIF(s.nm_lemb, ''), (SELECT s2.nm_lemb FROM feeder_kelas_kuliah kk JOIN sms s2 ON s2.id_sms = kk.id_sms WHERE kk.id_mk = mk.id_mk LIMIT 1), '') as nm_prodi FROM feeder_mata_kuliah mk LEFT JOIN sms s ON s.id_sms = mk.id_sms WHERE mk.kode_mk = ? LIMIT 1", [$row->kode_mk])->row();
            if ($mk && !empty($mk->nm_prodi)) $prodi = $mk->nm_prodi;
        }
        if (empty($prodi) && !empty($row->nm_mk)) {
            $mk = $this->db->query("SELECT COALESCE(NULLIF(s.nm_lemb, ''), (SELECT s2.nm_lemb FROM feeder_kelas_kuliah kk JOIN sms s2 ON s2.id_sms = kk.id_sms WHERE kk.id_mk = mk.id_mk LIMIT 1), '') as nm_prodi FROM feeder_mata_kuliah mk LEFT JOIN sms s ON s.id_sms = mk.id_sms WHERE mk.nm_mk = ? LIMIT 1", [$row->nm_mk])->row();
            if ($mk && !empty($mk->nm_prodi)) $prodi = $mk->nm_prodi;
        }
        return $prodi;
    }

    /**
     * AJAX: Periksa apakah Mata Kuliah yang dipilih sudah pernah memiliki dokumen RPS tersimpan
     */
    public function ajax_check_existing_rps_mk()
    {
        $this->output->set_content_type('application/json');
        $id_ptk  = $this->session->userdata('id_ptk');
        $id_rps  = (int)($this->input->post('id_rps') ?: $this->input->get('id_rps'));
        $kode_mk = trim($this->input->post('kode_mk'));
        $nm_mk   = trim($this->input->post('nm_mk'));

        $this->load->model('Rps_obe_model');
        
        $row = null;
        if (!empty($id_rps)) {
            $row = $this->db->where('id_rps', $id_rps)->get('siakad_rps_obe')->row();
        }
        if (!$row && !empty($kode_mk)) {
            if (!empty($id_ptk)) {
                $row = $this->db->where('kode_mk', $kode_mk)->where('id_ptk', $id_ptk)->order_by('id_rps', 'DESC')->get('siakad_rps_obe')->row();
            }
            if (!$row) {
                $row = $this->db->where('kode_mk', $kode_mk)->order_by('id_rps', 'DESC')->get('siakad_rps_obe')->row();
            }
        }
        if (!$row && !empty($nm_mk)) {
            if (!empty($id_ptk)) {
                $row = $this->db->where('nm_mk', $nm_mk)->where('id_ptk', $id_ptk)->order_by('id_rps', 'DESC')->get('siakad_rps_obe')->row();
            }
            if (!$row) {
                $row = $this->db->where('nm_mk', $nm_mk)->order_by('id_rps', 'DESC')->get('siakad_rps_obe')->row();
            }
        }

        if ($row) {
            $prodi = $this->_resolve_prodi_for_rps($row);
            $row->nama_prodi = $prodi;
            $row->prodi = $prodi;

            $details = $this->Rps_obe_model->get_details($row->id_rps);
            echo json_encode([
                'status'  => true,
                'found'   => true,
                'rps'     => $row,
                'details' => $details
            ]);
        } else {
            echo json_encode(['status' => true, 'found' => false]);
        }
    }

    /**
     * AJAX: Muat data RPS OBE yang tersimpan untuk diedit ulang di Workbench AI
     */
    public function ajax_load_rps_obe()
    {
        $this->output->set_content_type('application/json');
        $id_ptk = $this->session->userdata('id_ptk');
        $id_rps = (int)$this->input->post('id_rps');

        $this->load->model('Rps_obe_model');
        $row = $this->Rps_obe_model->get_by_id($id_rps);

        if ($row && $row->id_ptk == $id_ptk) {
            $prodi = $this->_resolve_prodi_for_rps($row);
            $row->nama_prodi = $prodi;
            $row->prodi = $prodi;

            $row->deskripsi_mata_kuliah = $this->_clean_deskripsi_text($row->deskripsi_mata_kuliah);
            $row->referensi = $this->_clean_referensi_text($row->referensi);

            $details = $this->Rps_obe_model->get_details($id_rps);
            if (!empty($row->raw_ai_output)) {
                $prak_target = (int)$row->sks_prak > 0 ? (int)$row->sks_prak : 2;
                $tm_target = (int)$row->sks_tm > 0 ? (int)$row->sks_tm : 1;
                $ratio_str = ($tm_target * 50) . '/' . ($prak_target * 50);
                $row->raw_ai_output = preg_replace('/\|\s*(?:50|100|150)\s*\/\s*0\s*\|/i', "| {$ratio_str} |", $row->raw_ai_output);
            }
            echo json_encode([
                'status'  => true,
                'rps'     => $row,
                'details' => $details
            ]);
        } else {
            echo json_encode(['status' => false, 'msg' => 'Data RPS OBE tidak ditemukan.']);
        }
    }

    private function _parse_markdown_table_to_matrix($markdown_text, $sks_mk = 3, $sks_tm = 2, $sks_prak = 1)
    {
        $rows = [];
        if (empty($markdown_text)) return $rows;

        $lines = explode("\n", str_replace("\r", "", $markdown_text));
        $tables = [];
        $current_table = null;
        $in_table = false;
        $found_divider = false;

        foreach ($lines as $line) {
            $trim_line = trim($line);
            if (str_starts_with($trim_line, '|') || str_ends_with($trim_line, '|')) {
                if (!$in_table) {
                    $in_table = true;
                    $found_divider = false;
                    $current_table = [
                        'headers' => [],
                        'rows'    => []
                    ];
                }

                if (preg_match('/^\|?[\s\-:|]+\|?$/', $trim_line) && str_contains($trim_line, '-')) {
                    $found_divider = true;
                    continue;
                }

                $cells = array_map('trim', explode('|', trim($trim_line, '|')));
                if (count($cells) >= 3) {
                    if (!$found_divider) {
                        $current_table['headers'] = $cells;
                    } else {
                        $current_table['rows'][] = $cells;
                    }
                }
            } else {
                if ($in_table) {
                    if (!empty($current_table['rows'])) {
                        $tables[] = $current_table;
                    }
                    $in_table = false;
                    $found_divider = false;
                    $current_table = null;
                }
            }
        }
        if ($in_table && !empty($current_table['rows'])) {
            $tables[] = $current_table;
        }

        if (empty($tables)) return $rows;

        // Score each table to find the weekly meetings table (16 meetings)
        $best_table = null;
        $best_score = -999;

        foreach ($tables as $t) {
            $header_str = strtolower(implode(' ', $t['headers']));
            $score = 0;

            if (preg_match('/minggu|temu|pertemuan/i', $header_str)) $score += 30;
            if (preg_match('/kemampuan akhir|sub.?cpmk|sasaran belajar/i', $header_str)) $score += 25;
            if (preg_match('/bahan kajian|materi|pokok bahasan/i', $header_str)) $score += 20;
            if (preg_match('/bentuk.*modalitas|bentuk.*pembelajaran/i', $header_str)) $score += 15;
            if (preg_match('/pengalaman.*belajar/i', $header_str)) $score += 15;
            if (preg_match('/alokasi.*waktu|waktu/i', $header_str)) $score += 10;
            if (preg_match('/kriteria|indikator|asesmen|evaluasi/i', $header_str)) $score += 10;

            $row_count = count($t['rows']);
            if ($row_count >= 14) $score += 50;
            elseif ($row_count >= 10) $score += 20;
            elseif ($row_count < 10) $score -= 20;

            if (preg_match('/kode cpmk|total bobot cpmk|akumulasi bobot/i', $header_str) && !preg_match('/minggu|pertemuan/i', $header_str)) {
                $score -= 50;
            }

            if ($score > $best_score) {
                $best_score = $score;
                $best_table = $t;
            }
        }

        if (!$best_table || empty($best_table['rows'])) return $rows;

        $header_cells = $best_table['headers'];
        $data_rows = $best_table['rows'];

        // Map column indices from header
        $col_map = [
            'minggu'      => -1,
            'sub_cpmk'    => -1,
            'bahan_kajian'=> -1,
            'bentuk'      => -1,
            'metode'      => -1,
            'pengalaman'  => -1,
            'waktu'       => -1,
            'waktu_t'     => -1,
            'waktu_p'     => -1,
            'evaluasi'    => -1,
            'kriteria'    => -1,
            'indikator'   => -1,
            'bobot'       => -1,
            'sumber'      => -1,
        ];

        foreach ($header_cells as $idx => $h) {
            $h_low = strtolower($h);
            if (preg_match('/minggu|temu|pertemuan/i', $h_low)) $col_map['minggu'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/sub.?cpmk|kemampuan akhir|sasaran belajar/i', $h_low)) $col_map['sub_cpmk'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/bahan kajian|materi|pokok bahasan/i', $h_low)) $col_map['bahan_kajian'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/bentuk.*modalitas|bentuk.*pembelajaran/i', $h_low)) $col_map['bentuk'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/metode/i', $h_low)) $col_map['metode'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/pengalaman/i', $h_low)) $col_map['pengalaman'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/waktu.*t\b|teori/i', $h_low)) $col_map['waktu_t'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/waktu.*p\b|praktek|praktikum/i', $h_low)) $col_map['waktu_p'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/alokasi|waktu|durasi/i', $h_low)) $col_map['waktu'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/evaluasi|penilaian|asesmen/i', $h_low)) $col_map['evaluasi'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/kriteria/i', $h_low)) $col_map['kriteria'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/indikator/i', $h_low)) $col_map['indikator'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/^\s*(?:bobot|persen|%)\b/i', $h_low)) $col_map['bobot'] = $idx;
            elseif (preg_match('/sumber|referensi|pustaka|rujukan/i', $h_low)) $col_map['sumber'] = $idx;
        }

        // Hitung pembagian SKS Teori dan Praktek
        $sks_mk = (int)$sks_mk > 0 ? (int)$sks_mk : 3;
        $sks_tm = (int)$sks_tm;
        $sks_prak = (int)$sks_prak;

        if ($sks_tm > 0 && $sks_prak > 0 && ($sks_tm + $sks_prak) == $sks_mk) {
            $calc_sks_tm = $sks_tm;
            $calc_sks_prak = $sks_prak;
        } elseif ($sks_mk == 3) {
            if ($sks_tm == 1 && $sks_prak == 2) {
                $calc_sks_tm = 1;
                $calc_sks_prak = 2;
            } else {
                $calc_sks_tm = 2;
                $calc_sks_prak = 1;
            }
        } elseif ($sks_mk == 2) {
            $calc_sks_tm = 2;
            $calc_sks_prak = 0;
        } elseif ($sks_mk == 4) {
            $calc_sks_tm = 2;
            $calc_sks_prak = 2;
        } else {
            $calc_sks_tm = $sks_mk;
            $calc_sks_prak = 0;
        }

        // Build Sub-CPMK map from all tables in raw markdown (e.g. Blueprint Asesmen / Matriks CPMK)
        $sub_cpmk_dict = [];
        if (preg_match_all('/\|\s*(?:CPMK[-_\s]*\d+)?\s*\|\s*(Sub[-_\s]*CPMK\s*[\d\.]+)\s*\|\s*([^\|]+)\|/i', $markdown_text, $m_sub_tbl, PREG_SET_ORDER)) {
            foreach ($m_sub_tbl as $st) {
                $k = strtoupper(preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9]/', '', $st[1]));
                $desc = trim($st[2]);
                if (!empty($desc) && stripos($desc, 'Bahan Kajian') === false && stripos($desc, 'Kemampuan Akhir') === false && stripos($desc, '---') === false) {
                    $sub_cpmk_dict[$k] = $desc;
                }
            }
        }
        if (preg_match_all('/(?:^|\n)\s*[\-\*•]?\s*(Sub[-_\s]*CPMK\s*[\d\.]+)\s*[:\-]\s*([^\n\r]+)/i', $markdown_text, $m_sub_txt, PREG_SET_ORDER)) {
            foreach ($m_sub_txt as $st) {
                $k = strtoupper(preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9]/', '', $st[1]));
                $desc = trim($st[2]);
                if (!empty($desc) && empty($sub_cpmk_dict[$k])) {
                    $sub_cpmk_dict[$k] = $desc;
                }
            }
        }

        foreach ($data_rows as $idx => $cells) {
            $temu_raw = ($col_map['minggu'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['minggu']])) ? $cells[$col_map['minggu']] : ($cells[0] ?? ($idx + 1));
            $minggu = $idx + 1;
            $pertemuan = $idx + 1;
            if (preg_match('/(\d+)/', $temu_raw, $tm)) {
                $pertemuan = (int)$tm[1];
                $minggu = $pertemuan;
            }

            $sub_cpmk = ($col_map['sub_cpmk'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['sub_cpmk']])) ? $cells[$col_map['sub_cpmk']] : ($cells[1] ?? '');

            // Enrich short sub_cpmk code to full learning capability
            $clean_sub = preg_replace('/[*_`]/', '', $sub_cpmk);
            $norm_k = strtoupper(preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9]/', '', $clean_sub));
            if (isset($sub_cpmk_dict[$norm_k]) && (mb_strlen($clean_sub) <= 22 || preg_match('/^Sub[-_\s]*CPMK\s*[\d\.]+$/i', trim($clean_sub)))) {
                $code_pfx = trim($clean_sub, ' :-');
                $sub_cpmk = $code_pfx . ': ' . $sub_cpmk_dict[$norm_k];
            } elseif ($pertemuan === 8 && (mb_strlen($clean_sub) < 25 || stripos($clean_sub, 'Evaluasi') === false)) {
                $sub_cpmk = 'Evaluasi Tengah Semester (UTS): Mengukur ketercapaian Sub-CPMK Minggu 1 s.d. 7';
            } elseif ($pertemuan === 16 && (mb_strlen($clean_sub) < 25 || stripos($clean_sub, 'Evaluasi') === false)) {
                $sub_cpmk = 'Evaluasi Akhir Semester (UAS): Mengukur ketercapaian seluruh CPMK (Komprehensif)';
            }

            $bahan_kajian = ($col_map['bahan_kajian'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['bahan_kajian']])) ? $cells[$col_map['bahan_kajian']] : ($cells[2] ?? '');
            
            $bentuk = ($col_map['bentuk'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['bentuk']])) ? $cells[$col_map['bentuk']] : 'Kuliah';
            $metode = ($col_map['metode'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['metode']])) ? $cells[$col_map['metode']] : 'Diskusi interaktif';
            
            if ($col_map['bentuk'] < 0 && $col_map['metode'] < 0 && isset($cells[3])) {
                $bentuk = 'Kuliah';
                $metode = $cells[3];
            }

            $pengalaman = ($col_map['pengalaman'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['pengalaman']])) ? $cells[$col_map['pengalaman']] : ($cells[4] ?? 'Diskusi dan penugasan');

            // Parse Waktu Teori (T) dan Praktek (P) dalam menit
            $waktu_t = $calc_sks_tm * 50;
            $waktu_p = $calc_sks_prak * 50;

            if ($col_map['waktu_t'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['waktu_t']])) {
                $raw_t = $cells[$col_map['waktu_t']];
                if (preg_match('/(\d+)\s*[xX*]\s*(\d+)/', $raw_t, $m_mult)) {
                    $waktu_t = (int)$m_mult[1] * (int)$m_mult[2];
                } elseif (preg_match('/(\d+)\s*[\/:]\s*(\d+)/', $raw_t, $w_pair)) {
                    $waktu_t = (int)$w_pair[1];
                    $waktu_p = (int)$w_pair[2];
                } elseif (preg_match('/^(\d{1,3})/', $raw_t, $m_num)) {
                    $w_num = (int)$m_num[1];
                    if ($w_num >= 50 && $w_num <= 240) $waktu_t = $w_num;
                }
            }

            if ($col_map['waktu_p'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['waktu_p']])) {
                $raw_p = $cells[$col_map['waktu_p']];
                if (preg_match('/(\d+)\s*[xX*]\s*(\d+)/', $raw_p, $m_mult)) {
                    $waktu_p = (int)$m_mult[1] * (int)$m_mult[2];
                } elseif (preg_match('/^(\d{1,3})/', $raw_p, $m_num)) {
                    $w_num = (int)$m_num[1];
                    if ($w_num <= 240) $waktu_p = $w_num;
                }
            }

            if ($col_map['waktu'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['waktu']])) {
                $w_raw = $cells[$col_map['waktu']];
                if (preg_match('/T\s*[:=]?\s*(\d+)/i', $w_raw, $wt)) {
                    $waktu_t = (int)$wt[1];
                }
                if (preg_match('/P\s*[:=]?\s*(\d+)/i', $w_raw, $wp)) {
                    $waktu_p = (int)$wp[1];
                }
                if (preg_match('/(\d+)\s*[\/:]\s*(\d+)/', $w_raw, $w_pair)) {
                    $waktu_t = (int)$w_pair[1];
                    $waktu_p = (int)$w_pair[2];
                }
            }

            // Pastikan total menit per pertemuan sama dengan SKS (misal 3 SKS = 150 menit)
            if (($waktu_t + $waktu_p) != ($sks_mk * 50)) {
                $waktu_t = $calc_sks_tm * 50;
                $waktu_p = $calc_sks_prak * 50;
            }

            // Kriteria & Indikator & Bobot
            $eval_cell = ($col_map['evaluasi'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['evaluasi']])) ? $cells[$col_map['evaluasi']] : '';
            $kriteria = 'Rubrik Asesmen';
            $indikator = 'Ketepatan pemahaman';
            $bobot = null;

            if ($col_map['kriteria'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['kriteria']])) {
                $kriteria = trim(strip_tags($cells[$col_map['kriteria']]));
            }
            if ($col_map['indikator'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['indikator']])) {
                $indikator = trim(strip_tags($cells[$col_map['indikator']]));
            }
            if ($col_map['bobot'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['bobot']])) {
                if (preg_match('/(\d{1,3})\s*%/i', $cells[$col_map['bobot']], $mb_pure)) {
                    $bobot = (int)$mb_pure[1];
                } else {
                    $b_val = (int)preg_replace('/[^0-9]/', '', $cells[$col_map['bobot']]);
                    if ($b_val > 0 && $b_val <= 100) $bobot = $b_val;
                }
            }

            // Parsing jika evaluasi digabung (Kriteria, Indikator, Bobot dalam 1 cell)
            if (!empty($eval_cell)) {
                if ($bobot === null) {
                    if (preg_match('/(?:bobot|persen|%)[^:\d]*[:\s=]\s*(\d{1,3})\s*%/i', $eval_cell, $mbob)) {
                        $bobot = (int)$mbob[1];
                    } elseif (preg_match('/(\d{1,3})\s*%/i', $eval_cell, $mbob)) {
                        $bobot = (int)$mbob[1];
                    }
                }
                if ($col_map['kriteria'] < 0 && preg_match('/(?:kriteria|rubrik)[^:]*:\s*([^<\n]+)/i', $eval_cell, $mkrit)) {
                    $kriteria = trim(strip_tags($mkrit[1]));
                }
                if ($col_map['indikator'] < 0 && preg_match('/(?:indikator)[^:]*:\s*([^<\n]+)/i', $eval_cell, $mind)) {
                    $indikator = trim(strip_tags($mind[1]));
                }
            }

            // Bersihkan format markdown asterisks
            $kriteria = trim($kriteria, "* \t\n\r\0\x0B");
            $indikator = trim($indikator, "* \t\n\r\0\x0B");

            // Bobot fallback jika tidak terdeteksi
            if ($bobot === null) {
                if ($pertemuan == 8) {
                    $bobot = 25; // Evaluasi Tengah Semester (UTS)
                } elseif ($pertemuan == 16) {
                    $bobot = 25; // Evaluasi Akhir Semester (UAS)
                } elseif ($pertemuan == 7 || $pertemuan == 14) {
                    $bobot = 10; // Tugas Terstruktur / Proyek
                } else {
                    $bobot = 3;  // Formatif Mingguan (Kuis/Partisipasi)
                }
            }

            // Sumber Belajar
            $sumber = ($col_map['sumber'] >= 0 && isset($cells[$col_map['sumber']])) ? $cells[$col_map['sumber']] : (end($cells) ?: '');

            $to_bold = function($str) {
                if (empty($str)) return '';
                $str = preg_replace('/\s+data-[a-z0-9_\-]+="[^"]*"/i', '', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/\s+data-[a-z0-9_\-]+=\'[^\']*\'/i', '', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/\s*style="[^"]*"/i', '', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/<(\/)?strong\b[^>]*>/i', '<$1b>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/<(\/)?em\b[^>]*>/i', '<$1i>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/\*\*\*(.*?)\*\*\*/s', '<b><i>$1</i></b>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/\*\*_(.*?)_\*\*/s', '<b><i>$1</i></b>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/\*\*(.*?)\*\*/s', '<b>$1</b>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/(?<!\w)__(.*?)__(?!\w)/s', '<b>$1</b>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/(?<!\*)\*(?!\s)([^\*\n]+?)(?<!\s)\*(?!\*)/', '<i>$1</i>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/(?<![a-zA-Z0-9_])_(?!\s)([^_\n]+?)(?<!\s)_(?![a-zA-Z0-9_])/', '<i>$1</i>', $str);
                $str = preg_replace('/<\/?(?:span|font)\b[^>]*>/i', '', $str);
                return trim($str);
            };

            $rows[] = [
                'minggu'              => $minggu,
                'pertemuan'           => $pertemuan,
                'sub_cpmk'            => $to_bold($sub_cpmk),
                'bahan_kajian'        => $to_bold($bahan_kajian),
                'bentuk_pembelajaran' => $to_bold($bentuk),
                'metode'              => $to_bold($metode),
                'pengalaman_belajar'  => $to_bold($pengalaman),
                'waktu_teori'         => $waktu_t,
                'waktu_praktek'       => $waktu_p,
                'kriteria_evaluasi'   => $to_bold($kriteria),
                'indikator_evaluasi'  => $to_bold($indikator),
                'bobot'               => $bobot,
                'sumber_belajar'      => $to_bold($sumber)
            ];
        }

        return $rows;
    }

    /**
     * Normalisasi format tabel Markdown agar selalu memenuhi standar GFM yang valid:
     * - Memperbaiki delimiter baris yang terputus / multi-line
     * - Memastikan jarak baris kosong sebelum tabel
     * - Menghilangkan spasi awal yang dapat mengacaukan parsing Markdown
     */
    private function sanitize_markdown_tables($md)
    {
        if (empty($md)) return $md;

        $md = str_replace(["\r\n", "\r"], "\n", $md);
        $lines = explode("\n", $md);
        $cleanedLines = [];
        $count = count($lines);
        $inTable = false;
        $tableHasDelimiter = false;

        for ($i = 0; $i < $count; $i++) {
            $rawLine = $lines[$i];
            $line = trim($rawLine);

            // Deteksi baris delimiter tabel markdown (|---|---| atau ---|---|)
            $isRow = strlen($line) > 0 && str_starts_with($line, '|') && substr_count($line, '|') >= 2;
            $isDelimiter = $isRow && preg_match('/^\|?[ \t]*[-:| \t]+\|?$/', $line) && !preg_match('/[a-zA-Z0-9]/', $line) && substr_count($line, '-') >= 2;

            if ($isDelimiter) {
                if ($inTable && !$tableHasDelimiter) {
                    $tableHasDelimiter = true;
                    $cleanedLines[] = $line;
                    continue;
                } elseif ($inTable && $tableHasDelimiter) {
                    continue;
                }
            }

            if ($isRow) {
                if (!$inTable) {
                    if (!empty($cleanedLines) && trim(end($cleanedLines)) !== '') {
                        $cleanedLines[] = '';
                    }
                    $inTable = true;
                    $tableHasDelimiter = false;
                } else {
                    // Jika di tengah tabel muncul header berulang, lewati
                    if (preg_match('/^\|\s*(?:Minggu|No|Kemampuan|CPMK|Sub-CPMK|Modul)\s*\|/i', $line)) {
                        if ($i + 1 < $count && preg_match('/^\|?[ \t]*[-:| \t]+\|?$/', trim($lines[$i + 1]))) {
                            $i++;
                        }
                        continue;
                    }
                }
                $cleanedLines[] = $line;
                continue;
            }

            // Baris kosong
            if ($line === '') {
                $nextIsRow = false;
                for ($j = $i + 1; $j < $count; $j++) {
                    if (trim($lines[$j]) === '') continue;
                    if (str_starts_with(trim($lines[$j]), '|')) $nextIsRow = true;
                    break;
                }
                if ($inTable && $nextIsRow) {
                    continue; // Jangan putus tabel dengan baris kosong
                }
                $inTable = false;
                $tableHasDelimiter = false;
                $cleanedLines[] = '';
                continue;
            }

            // Non-table line
            $inTable = false;
            $tableHasDelimiter = false;

            if (preg_match('/^(?:#{1,6}\s+|[A-Z]\.\s+[A-Z])/', $line)) {
                if (!empty($cleanedLines) && trim(end($cleanedLines)) !== '') {
                    $cleanedLines[] = '';
                }
            }

            $cleanedLines[] = $line;
        }

        return implode("\n", $cleanedLines);
    }

    /**
     * Download Excel Formula Template for CPMK Assessment & Attainment Evaluation
     */
    public function download_template_evaluasi_cpmk()
    {
        $template_path = APPPATH . 'libraries/ai_skills/akademik-dosen-obe-fiq/templates/template_evaluasi_cpmk_bobot_asesmen.xlsx';
        if (!file_exists($template_path)) {
            show_error('Berkas template evaluasi CPMK tidak ditemukan di server: ' . $template_path);
            return;
        }

        $nama_mk = preg_replace('/[^A-Za-z0-9_\-]/', '_', $this->input->get('nama_mk') ?: 'Mata_Kuliah');
        $filename = 'Template_Evaluasi_CPMK_' . $nama_mk . '.xlsx';

        header('Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet');
        header('Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="' . $filename . '"');
        header('Cache-Control: max-age=0');
        readfile($template_path);
        exit;
    }

    /**
     * AJAX: Get active teaching schedules for the logged-in lecturer
     */
    public function ajax_get_dosen_schedules()
    {
        $this->output->set_content_type('application/json');
        $id_ptk = $this->session->userdata('id_ptk');
        $id_smt = $this->session->userdata('tahun_ajaran');
        $kode_mk = trim($this->input->post('kode_mk'));

        $this->db->select('j.id as id_jadwal, j.tag_name, j.id_hari, h.nama_hari, j.jam_mulai, j.jam_selesai, j.is_generate_bap, r.nama_ruang')
            ->select('(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM siakad_rencana_pertemuan WHERE id_jadwal = j.id) as total_rencana')
            ->select('(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM siakad_rencana_pertemuan WHERE id_jadwal = j.id AND is_realisasi = 1) as total_realisasi')
            ->from('siakad_jadwal j')
            ->join('siakad_hari h', 'h.uniq = j.id_hari', 'left')
            ->join('siakad_ruang r', 'r.uniq = j.id_ruang', 'left')
            ->where('j.id_sdm', $id_ptk)
            ->where('j.id_smt', $id_smt)
            ->order_by('j.id_hari', 'ASC')
            ->order_by('j.jam_mulai', 'ASC');

        $schedules = $this->db->get()->result();
        $filtered_schedules = [];

        foreach ($schedules as $sch) {
            $details = $this->db->select('kk.nm_kls, mk.kode_mk, mk.nm_mk, mk.sks_tm, mk.sks_prak, s.nm_lemb as nm_prodi')
                ->from('siakad_jadwal_detail jd')
                ->join('feeder_kelas_kuliah kk', 'jd.id_kls = kk.id_kls')
                ->join('feeder_mata_kuliah mk', 'kk.id_mk = mk.id_mk')
                ->join('sms s', 's.id_sms = kk.id_sms', 'left')
                ->where('jd.id_jadwal', $sch->id_jadwal)
                ->get()->result();

            // Filter jadwal non-tatap muka kelas (KKN, PKL, MBKM, Tugas Akhir, Skripsi, Magang, dll.)
            if ($this->_is_non_classroom_course($sch->tag_name)) {
                continue;
            }

            $is_non_class = false;
            foreach ($details as $d) {
                if ($this->_is_non_classroom_course($d->nm_mk, $d->kode_mk)) {
                    $is_non_class = true;
                    break;
                }
            }
            if ($is_non_class) {
                continue;
            }

            $sch->kelas_list  = $details;
            $sch->is_match_mk = false;
            $sch->nm_prodi    = $details[0]->nm_prodi ?? '';
            $sch->nm_mk       = $details[0]->nm_mk ?? '';
            $sch->kode_mk     = $details[0]->kode_mk ?? '';

            $full_labels = [];
            foreach ($details as $d) {
                $prodi_str = !empty($d->nm_prodi) ? ' (' . $d->nm_prodi . ')' : '';
                $mk_info = !empty($d->nm_mk) ? $d->nm_mk : 'Mata Kuliah';
                $kode_info = !empty($d->kode_mk) ? '[' . $d->kode_mk . '] ' : '';
                
                $full_labels[] = $kode_info . $mk_info . ' - Kelas ' . $d->nm_kls . $prodi_str;

                if (!empty($kode_mk) && strcasecmp(trim((string)$d->kode_mk), $kode_mk) === 0) {
                    $sch->is_match_mk = true;
                }
            }
            $sch->label_kelas = implode(' & ', $full_labels);
            $filtered_schedules[] = $sch;
        }

        $matching_schedules = [];
        $other_schedules = [];

        foreach ($filtered_schedules as $sch) {
            if ($sch->is_match_mk) {
                $matching_schedules[] = $sch;
            } else {
                $other_schedules[] = $sch;
            }
        }

        echo json_encode([
            'status'             => true,
            'schedules'          => $filtered_schedules,
            'matching_schedules' => $matching_schedules,
            'other_schedules'    => $other_schedules
        ]);
    }

    /**
     * AJAX: Sync Learning Scenario & BAP Draft to siakad_rencana_pertemuan for class schedule(s)
     */
    public function ajax_sync_to_jadwal_kelas()
    {
        $this->output->set_content_type('application/json');
        $id_ptk      = $this->session->userdata('id_ptk');
        
        // Support multiple selected schedules (array) or single id_jadwal
        $id_jadwal_raw = $this->input->post('id_jadwal_list');
        $id_jadwal_single = $this->input->post('id_jadwal');

        $target_ids = [];
        if (is_array($id_jadwal_raw) && !empty($id_jadwal_raw)) {
            foreach ($id_jadwal_raw as $jid) {
                $jid_int = (int)$jid;
                if ($jid_int > 0 && !in_array($jid_int, $target_ids)) {
                    $target_ids[] = $jid_int;
                }
            }
        } elseif (!empty($id_jadwal_single)) {
            $target_ids[] = (int)$id_jadwal_single;
        }

        if (empty($target_ids)) {
            echo json_encode(['status' => false, 'msg' => 'Silakan pilih minimal 1 kelas jadwal perkuliahan target.']);
            return;
        }

        $id_rps           = (int)$this->input->post('id_rps');
        $start_date_input = $this->input->post('tanggal_mulai');
        $skenario_md      = $this->input->post('skenario_markdown');
        $matrix_json      = $this->input->post('matrix_json');
        $overwrite        = (int)$this->input->post('overwrite') === 1;

        // Load all target schedules belonging to this lecturer
        $all_target_jadwals = $this->db
            ->select('j.*, h.nama_hari, r.nama_ruang')
            ->from('siakad_jadwal j')
            ->join('siakad_hari h', 'h.uniq = j.id_hari', 'left')
            ->join('siakad_ruang r', 'r.uniq = j.id_ruang', 'left')
            ->where_in('j.id', $target_ids)
            ->where('j.id_sdm', $id_ptk)
            ->get()->result();

        if (empty($all_target_jadwals)) {
            echo json_encode(['status' => false, 'msg' => 'Jadwal perkuliahan target tidak ditemukan atau bukan kelas yang Anda ampu.']);
            return;
        }

        // Load RPS data if needed
        $this->load->model('Rps_obe_model');
        if (empty($skenario_md) && !empty($id_rps)) {
            $rps_row = $this->db->where('id_rps', $id_rps)->get('siakad_rps_obe')->row();
            if ($rps_row) {
                $skenario_md = $rps_row->skenario_pembelajaran_markdown ?: $rps_row->raw_ai_output;
            }
        }

        $parsed_meetings = $this->_parse_skenario_pertemuan_markdown($skenario_md);

        // Fallback to matrix details if some meetings missing
        if (count($parsed_meetings) < 16 && !empty($id_rps)) {
            $details = $this->Rps_obe_model->get_details($id_rps);
            foreach ($details as $d) {
                $p_num = (int)$d->kolom_2;
                if ($p_num > 0 && !isset($parsed_meetings[$p_num])) {
                    $parsed_meetings[$p_num] = [
                        'pertemuan'            => $p_num,
                        'minggu'               => (int)($d->kolom_1 ?: $p_num),
                        'sub_cpmk'             => $d->kolom_3,
                        'bahan_kajian'         => $d->kolom_4,
                        'berita_acara_rencana' => "🎯 **Target:** " . ($d->kolom_3 ?: '') . "\n📋 **Strategi SCL:** " . ($d->kolom_5 ?: 'Kuliah Interaktif') . " (" . ($d->kolom_6 ?: 'Diskusi') . ").\nPengalaman Belajar: " . $d->kolom_7,
                        'bacaan_materi'        => ($d->kolom_4 ? "Bahan Kajian: " . $d->kolom_4 . "\n" : "") . ($d->kolom_13 ? "Sumber Belajar: " . $d->kolom_13 : ""),
                        'draf_bap'             => "Realisasi Materi:\n" . ($d->kolom_4 ?: '-') . "\n\nAktivitas:\nPenjelasan konsep 20 menit, eksplorasi kasus 30 menit, praktik mahasiswa 70 menit, diskusi 20 menit.\n\nCapaian:\nSebagian besar mahasiswa memahami materi dan menyelesaikan latihan dengan baik.\n\nKendala:\nTidak ada kendala berarti.\n\nTindak lanjut:\nMahasiswa mengerjakan latihan tambahan.\n\nKesesuaian RPS: Sesuai RPS",
                        'jam_teori'            => (float)($d->kolom_8 ?: 1),
                        'jam_praktek'          => (float)($d->kolom_9 ?: 2)
                    ];
                }
            }
        }

        ksort($parsed_meetings);

        $sync_freq         = (int)($this->input->post('sync_freq') ?: 1);
        $id_jadwal_2       = (int)$this->input->post('id_jadwal_2');
        $sync_distribution = $this->input->post('sync_distribution') ?: 'alternating';

        // Helper closure to calculate base date for a given schedule day
        $calc_first_date = function($start_timestamp, $day_of_week) {
            $ts = $start_timestamp;
            if ($day_of_week > 0) {
                $start_w = (int)date('N', $ts);
                $diff_days = ($day_of_week - $start_w);
                if ($diff_days < 0) {
                    $diff_days += 7;
                }
                $ts = strtotime("+{$diff_days} day", $ts);
            }
            return $ts;
        };

        $start_timestamp = !empty($start_date_input) ? strtotime($start_date_input) : time();
        $user_id = $this->ion_auth->user()->row()->id ?? 1;
        $now_str = date('Y-m-d H:i:s');
        $total_inserted = 0;
        $total_updated  = 0;
        $processed_classes = [];

        // Function to sync 1 meeting row
        $sync_meeting_item = function($target_jadwal, $meet_no, $minggu_no, $meet_data, $tgl_rencana) use ($overwrite, $user_id, $now_str, &$total_inserted, &$total_updated) {
            $rencana_text = $meet_data['berita_acara_rencana'] ?? "Perkuliahan Pertemuan ke-{$meet_no}";
            $materi_text  = $meet_data['bacaan_materi'] ?? "Bahan Kajian Pertemuan ke-{$meet_no}";
            $bap_draft    = $meet_data['draf_bap'] ?? "Perkuliahan pertemuan ke-{$meet_no} telah terlaksana sesuai rencana.";
            $sub_cpmk_val = $meet_data['sub_cpmk'] ?? '';
            $metode_val   = $meet_data['metode'] ?? '';
            $evaluasi_val = $meet_data['indikator_evaluasi'] ?? '';
            $jam_t        = $meet_data['jam_teori'] ?? 1;
            $jam_p        = $meet_data['jam_praktek'] ?? 2;

            $exist = $this->db->where('id_jadwal', $target_jadwal->id)->where('pertemuan', $meet_no)->get('siakad_rencana_pertemuan')->row();

            if ($exist) {
                $upd = [
                    'sub_cpmk'             => $sub_cpmk_val,
                    'metode_pembelajaran'  => $metode_val,
                    'indikator_evaluasi'   => $evaluasi_val,
                    'berita_acara_rencana' => $rencana_text,
                    'bacaan_materi'        => $materi_text,
                    'draf_bap'             => $bap_draft,
                    'jam_teori'            => $jam_t,
                    'jam_praktek'          => $jam_p,
                    'change_by'            => $user_id,
                    'change_date'          => $now_str
                ];
                if ($exist->is_realisasi == 0 && $overwrite) {
                    $upd['tanggal_rencana'] = $tgl_rencana;
                    $upd['jam_mulai']       = $target_jadwal->jam_mulai;
                    $upd['jam_selesai']     = $target_jadwal->jam_selesai;
                }
                $this->db->where('uniq', $exist->uniq)->update('siakad_rencana_pertemuan', $upd);
                $total_updated++;
            } else {
                $ins = [
                    'id_jadwal'            => $target_jadwal->id,
                    'pertemuan'            => $meet_no,
                    'minggu'               => $minggu_no,
                    'sub_cpmk'             => $sub_cpmk_val,
                    'metode_pembelajaran'  => $metode_val,
                    'indikator_evaluasi'   => $evaluasi_val,
                    'tanggal_rencana'      => $tgl_rencana,
                    'jam_mulai'            => $target_jadwal->jam_mulai,
                    'jam_selesai'          => $target_jadwal->jam_selesai,
                    'jam_teori'            => $jam_t,
                    'jam_praktek'          => $jam_p,
                    'berita_acara_rencana' => $rencana_text,
                    'bacaan_materi'        => $materi_text,
                    'draf_bap'             => $bap_draft,
                    'is_realisasi'         => 0,
                    'create_by'            => $user_id,
                    'create_date'          => $now_str
                ];
                $this->db->insert('siakad_rencana_pertemuan', $ins);
                $total_inserted++;
            }
        };

        // If 2 sessions per week alternating mode for single schedule
        if ($sync_freq === 2 && count($all_target_jadwals) === 1 && !empty($id_jadwal_2)) {
            $jadwal = $all_target_jadwals[0];
            $jadwal_2 = $this->db->where('id', $id_jadwal_2)->where('id_sdm', $id_ptk)->get('siakad_jadwal')->row();
            if ($jadwal_2 && $sync_distribution === 'alternating') {
                $first_ts_1 = $calc_first_date($start_timestamp, (int)$jadwal->id_hari);
                $first_ts_2 = $calc_first_date($start_timestamp, (int)$jadwal_2->id_hari);

                for ($meet_no = 1; $meet_no <= 16; $meet_no++) {
                    $meet_data = $parsed_meetings[$meet_no] ?? null;
                    $week_idx = (int)ceil($meet_no / 2);
                    $week_offset_days = ($week_idx - 1) * 7;

                    if ($meet_no % 2 !== 0) {
                        $meet_ts = strtotime("+{$week_offset_days} day", $first_ts_1);
                        $sync_meeting_item($jadwal, $meet_no, $week_idx, $meet_data, date('Y-m-d', $meet_ts));
                    } else {
                        $meet_ts = strtotime("+{$week_offset_days} day", $first_ts_2);
                        $sync_meeting_item($jadwal_2, $meet_no, $week_idx, $meet_data, date('Y-m-d', $meet_ts));
                    }
                }

                $this->db->where('id', $jadwal->id)->update('siakad_jadwal', ['is_generate_bap' => 1]);
                $this->db->where('id', $jadwal_2->id)->update('siakad_jadwal', ['is_generate_bap' => 1]);

                echo json_encode([
                    'status'         => true,
                    'msg'            => "Skenario Pembelajaran berhasil disinkronkan ke 2 Sesi Pertemuan Mingguan (Sesi 1: Ganjil, Sesi 2: Genap). Total {$total_inserted} pertemuan baru, {$total_updated} diperbarui.",
                    'inserted_count' => $total_inserted,
                    'updated_count'  => $total_updated
                ]);
                return;
            }
        }

        // Standard sync loop for each selected target schedule
        foreach ($all_target_jadwals as $target_jadwal) {
            $current_date_ts = $calc_first_date($start_timestamp, (int)$target_jadwal->id_hari);
            $meeting_date_ts = $current_date_ts;
            $last_minggu = 1;

            for ($meet_no = 1; $meet_no <= 16; $meet_no++) {
                $meet_data = $parsed_meetings[$meet_no] ?? null;
                $minggu_no = $meet_data['minggu'] ?? $meet_no;

                if ($meet_no > 1) {
                    if ($minggu_no != $last_minggu || $meet_no == 8 || $meet_no == 16) {
                        $meeting_date_ts = strtotime('+7 day', $meeting_date_ts);
                    }
                }
                $last_minggu = $minggu_no;

                $sync_meeting_item($target_jadwal, $meet_no, $minggu_no, $meet_data, date('Y-m-d', $meeting_date_ts));
            }

            $this->db->where('id', $target_jadwal->id)->update('siakad_jadwal', ['is_generate_bap' => 1]);
            $processed_classes[] = ($target_jadwal->nama_hari ? $target_jadwal->nama_hari . ' (' . substr($target_jadwal->jam_mulai,0,5) . ')' : 'Jadwal #' . $target_jadwal->id);
        }

        $class_summary = implode(', ', $processed_classes);

        echo json_encode([
            'status'         => true,
            'msg'            => "Skenario Pembelajaran & 16 Rencana Pertemuan Draf BAP berhasil disinkronkan ke " . count($all_target_jadwals) . " jadwal kelas ({$class_summary}). Total {$total_inserted} pertemuan baru ditambahkan, {$total_updated} diperbarui.",
            'inserted_count' => $total_inserted,
            'updated_count'  => $total_updated,
            'class_count'    => count($all_target_jadwals)
        ]);
    }

    /**
     * Helper: Parse Skenario Pembelajaran Markdown into structured 16 meetings array
     */
    private function _parse_skenario_pertemuan_markdown($md)
    {
        $meetings = [];
        if (empty($md)) return $meetings;

        $parts = preg_split('/(?=###\s*(?:📌\s*)?PERTEMUAN\s+(?:MINGGU\s+KE-|KE-)?\s*\d+)/i', $md);

        foreach ($parts as $part) {
            if (!preg_match('/###\s*(?:📌\s*)?PERTEMUAN\s+(?:MINGGU\s+KE-|KE-)?\s*(\d+)/i', $part, $m_num)) {
                continue;
            }
            $meet_no = (int)$m_num[1];
            if ($meet_no < 1 || $meet_no > 16) continue;

            $sub_cpmk = '';
            if (preg_match('/(?:\*|\-)?\s*\*\*Kemampuan Akhir[^\*]*\*\*:\s*([^\n]+)/i', $part, $m)) {
                $sub_cpmk = trim($m[1]);
            }

            $bahan_kajian = '';
            if (preg_match('/(?:\*|\-)?\s*\*\*Bahan Kajian\*\*:\s*([^\n]+)/i', $part, $m)) {
                $bahan_kajian = trim($m[1]);
            }

            $metode = '';
            if (preg_match('/(?:\*|\-)?\s*\*\*Bentuk & Metode[^\*]*\*\*:\s*([^\n]+)/i', $part, $m)) {
                $metode = trim($m[1]);
            }

            $sumber = '';
            if (preg_match('/(?:\*|\-)?\s*\*\*Sumber & Media Belajar\*\*:\s*([^\n]+)/i', $part, $m)) {
                $sumber = trim($m[1]);
            }

            $evaluasi = '';
            if (preg_match('/(?:\*|\-)?\s*\*\*Kriteria & Indikator[^\*]*\*\*:\s*([^\n]+)/i', $part, $m)) {
                $evaluasi = trim($m[1]);
            }

            $jam_t = 1; $jam_p = 2;
            if (preg_match('/(\d+)\s*Menit Teori\s*\/\s*(\d+)\s*Menit Praktek/i', $part, $m)) {
                $jam_t = round(((int)$m[1]) / 50, 1);
                $jam_p = round(((int)$m[2]) / 50, 1);
            }

            $skenario_scl = '';
            if (preg_match('/####\s*(?:Skenario Langkah Pembelajaran|Sintaks SCL|Skenario Langkah Pelaksanaan)[^\n]*\n([\s\S]*?)(?=(?:####|---|```text|\Z))/i', $part, $m)) {
                $skenario_scl = trim($m[1]);
            }

            $draf_bap = '';
            if (preg_match('/####\s*[^\n]*(?:Draft Evaluasi|Draf Evaluasi|Draf Realisasi Berita Acara|Draf BAP|BAP Faktual)[^\n]*\n(?:```(?:text|markdown)?\s*)?([\s\S]*?)(?:```|---|###|\Z)/i', $part, $m)) {
                $draf_bap = trim(str_replace(['```text', '```'], '', $m[1]));
            }

            $rencana_full = '';
            if (!empty($sub_cpmk)) {
                $rencana_full .= "🎯 Target Capaian: " . $sub_cpmk . "\n\n";
            }
            if (!empty($skenario_scl)) {
                $rencana_full .= "📋 Skenario Sintaks SCL:\n" . $skenario_scl;
            } elseif (!empty($bahan_kajian) || !empty($metode)) {
                $rencana_full .= "Aktivitas Perkuliahan: " . trim($bahan_kajian . (!empty($metode) ? " (" . $metode . ")" : ""));
            } else {
                $rencana_full .= "Rencana Pembelajaran Pertemuan " . $meet_no;
            }

            $bacaan_full = '';
            if (!empty($bahan_kajian)) {
                $bacaan_full .= "Bahan Kajian: " . $bahan_kajian;
            }
            if (!empty($sumber)) {
                $bacaan_full .= ($bacaan_full ? "\n" : "") . "Sumber Belajar: " . $sumber;
            }

            $meetings[$meet_no] = [
                'pertemuan'            => $meet_no,
                'minggu'               => $meet_no,
                'sub_cpmk'             => $sub_cpmk,
                'bahan_kajian'         => $bahan_kajian,
                'metode'               => $metode,
                'sumber'               => $sumber,
                'indikator_evaluasi'   => $evaluasi,
                'jam_teori'            => $jam_t,
                'jam_praktek'          => $jam_p,
                'berita_acara_rencana' => $rencana_full,
                'bacaan_materi'        => $bacaan_full,
                'draf_bap'             => $draf_bap
            ];
        }

        return $meetings;
    }
}

